<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.200" end="00:00:03.600" style="s2">I knew you before she did.</p>
<p begin="00:00:02.100" end="00:00:05.400" style="s2">I stood beside you when she was nowhere</p>
<p begin="00:00:03.600" end="00:00:06.700" style="s2">near your life. I thought time would</p>
<p begin="00:00:05.400" end="00:00:08.500" style="s2">make you see that I was the woman who</p>
<p begin="00:00:06.700" end="00:00:10.400" style="s2">belonged beside you.</p>
<p begin="00:00:08.500" end="00:00:11.700" style="s2">You want to make her your whole world?</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.400" end="00:00:14.200" style="s2">Let us see if your relationship can</p>
<p begin="00:00:11.700" end="00:00:14.200" style="s2">last.</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.000" end="00:00:23.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if the [music] choice of your heart</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.000" end="00:00:25.300" style="s2">is the one thing the whole world stands</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.100" end="00:00:28.300" style="s2">against? Welcome to Tales [music] by</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.300" end="00:00:31.000" style="s2">Amy. I am Amy and today&#39;s feature film</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.300" end="00:00:33.000" style="s2">follows Amy and Kingsley, whose age</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.000" end="00:00:36.000" style="s2">difference sparks [music] rumors, deep</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.000" end="00:00:38.500" style="s2">jealousy, and family judgment. This is</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.000" end="00:00:40.600" style="s2">an original work of fiction written for</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.500" end="00:00:44.100" style="s2">this [music] channel. Settle in and</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.600" end="00:00:44.100" style="s2">let&#39;s get right into the story.</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.540" end="00:00:48.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.600" end="00:00:50.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay with me.</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.600" end="00:00:51.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy, I am begging you in the name of</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.000" end="00:00:53.700" style="s2">everything good. Stop looking at every</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.800" end="00:00:55.300" style="s2">man&#39;s wristwatch and car key. Last week</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.700" end="00:00:57.300" style="s2">it was the man at the bank. Yesterday it</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.300" end="00:00:59.000" style="s2">was that old uncle in church.</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.300" end="00:01:01.200" style="s2">You are going to walk into a pole one of</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.000" end="00:01:02.300" style="s2">these days. Sharon, I am not looking at</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.200" end="00:01:03.700" style="s2">their wristwatch. I am looking at their</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.300" end="00:01:04.800" style="s2">maturity.</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.700" end="00:01:05.900" style="s2">The boys our age will promise you the</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.800" end="00:01:07.300" style="s2">moon in the morning and block your</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.900" end="00:01:09.300" style="s2">number by evening.</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.300" end="00:01:11.900" style="s2">I have already given one boy my whole</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.300" end="00:01:13.800" style="s2">heart and he used it as a doormat.</p>
<p begin="00:01:11.900" end="00:01:16.000" style="s2">My own mother says a woman should marry</p>
<p begin="00:01:13.800" end="00:01:17.900" style="s2">a man who has finished running around.</p>
<p begin="00:01:16.000" end="00:01:21.200" style="s2">So if I must love again, it will be a</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.900" end="00:01:21.200" style="s2">man who knows who he is.</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.900" end="00:01:34.300" style="s2">You this useless rich man, do you not</p>
<p begin="00:01:32.000" end="00:01:36.100" style="s2">have eyes? Is your car made of gold that</p>
<p begin="00:01:34.300" end="00:01:38.500" style="s2">you cannot slow down? MAY YOUR TIRES</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.100" end="00:01:38.500" style="s2">BURST.</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.800" end="00:01:46.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young ladies, I am truly sorry. My</p>
<p begin="00:01:45.000" end="00:01:48.900" style="s2">driver was in a hurry because of me, so</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.700" end="00:01:51.000" style="s2">the fault is mine. Money cannot undo a</p>
<p begin="00:01:48.900" end="00:01:53.600" style="s2">wet dress, but please allow me to repair</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.000" end="00:01:53.600" style="s2">the damage.</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.700" end="00:01:57.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, keep your money. A man who stops</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.600" end="00:01:59.400" style="s2">and apologizes when nobody forced him to</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.400" end="00:02:01.692" style="s2">is rare in this city. I will take the</p>
<p begin="00:01:59.400" end="00:02:03.392" style="s2">apology and the envelope. Just tell me</p>
<p begin="00:02:01.692" end="00:02:04.592" style="s2">your name so that I know whose mistake I</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.392" end="00:02:07.192" style="s2">am forgiving.</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.592" end="00:02:08.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kingsley, people call me Chief. Go well,</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.192" end="00:02:11.292" style="s2">my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.992" end="00:02:12.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy, did you just refuse money? You are</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.292" end="00:02:14.692" style="s2">wet like a fish and you are smiling like</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.792" end="00:02:16.692" style="s2">a bride. What is wrong with you?</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.692" end="00:02:18.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sharon, I think I just met my husband.</p>
<p begin="00:02:16.692" end="00:02:20.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That man called you my daughter. He is</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.492" end="00:02:23.592" style="s2">old enough to be your father and that is</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.292" end="00:02:23.592" style="s2">exactly why I want him.</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.492" end="00:02:28.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kingsley,</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.792" end="00:02:30.392" style="s2">Bisi has been in the ground for four</p>
<p begin="00:02:28.292" end="00:02:32.292" style="s2">years. Four years.</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.392" end="00:02:33.792" style="s2">This house has no woman&#39;s hand. Look at</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.292" end="00:02:35.892" style="s2">this table.</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.792" end="00:02:37.692" style="s2">Even the flowers are dying. I did not</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.892" end="00:02:39.192" style="s2">raise you to grow old alone.</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.692" end="00:02:40.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pauline, you did not raise me to forget</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.192" end="00:02:42.892" style="s2">either.</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.292" end="00:02:44.692" style="s2">Bisi was not a coat I wore and removed.</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.892" end="00:02:46.192" style="s2">When a man has loved one woman well, he</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.692" end="00:02:48.692" style="s2">does not simply look for another one the</p>
<p begin="00:02:46.192" end="00:02:50.292" style="s2">way one looks for a replacement phone.</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.692" end="00:02:52.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am not talking about a replacement. I</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.292" end="00:02:54.392" style="s2">am talking about glory. 40 years old,</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.692" end="00:02:55.992" style="s2">educated from a good family and she is</p>
<p begin="00:02:54.392" end="00:02:57.492" style="s2">ready. She will run this house and</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.992" end="00:02:59.292" style="s2">respect your children.</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.492" end="00:03:00.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Auntie, please we are right here. If</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.292" end="00:03:03.692" style="s2">Daddy wants a wife, he will say so. We</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.792" end="00:03:05.692" style="s2">are not furniture to be rearranged.</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.692" end="00:03:07.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zara has spoken the truth, Auntie. But</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.692" end="00:03:09.892" style="s2">if Daddy is happy, I will dance at the</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.192" end="00:03:09.892" style="s2">wedding myself.</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.607" end="00:03:12.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.157" end="00:03:20.592" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.092" end="00:03:23.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy, you have been standing there for 10</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.592" end="00:03:25.092" style="s2">minutes. Your outfit is still wet.</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.092" end="00:03:26.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I keep seeing his face, Sharon. He</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.092" end="00:03:28.092" style="s2">looked so calm even while we were</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.892" end="00:03:29.892" style="s2">shouting.</p>
<p begin="00:03:28.092" end="00:03:31.292" style="s2">That man soaked us with gutter water and</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.892" end="00:03:32.892" style="s2">drove away. Why are you still thinking</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.292" end="00:03:35.092" style="s2">about him?</p>
<p begin="00:03:32.892" end="00:03:35.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I cannot explain it. Maybe I am just</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.092" end="00:03:38.492" style="s2">tired.</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.792" end="00:03:39.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are not tired. You are distracted.</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.492" end="00:03:41.092" style="s2">He is a stranger. Get a grip on</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.892" end="00:03:42.992" style="s2">yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.092" end="00:03:44.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Age is only a number, Sharon.</p>
<p begin="00:03:42.992" end="00:03:46.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what is his number? You do not know</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.992" end="00:03:47.992" style="s2">his name, his house, or even if he is</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.692" end="00:03:49.192" style="s2">married.</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.992" end="00:03:51.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You told me you were done with love</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.192" end="00:03:52.992" style="s2">after Daniel. One man passing on the</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.292" end="00:03:54.992" style="s2">road cannot undo that.</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.992" end="00:03:55.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are right. I should not let this get</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.992" end="00:03:57.492" style="s2">to me.</p>
<p begin="00:03:55.892" end="00:03:59.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then change your clothes, eat something</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.492" end="00:04:00.292" style="s2">and think about your future, not a</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.192" end="00:04:03.294" style="s2">stranger.</p>
<p begin="00:04:00.292" end="00:04:05.094" style="s2">Tomorrow you have an interview.</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.294" end="00:04:06.894" style="s2">Stand straight. You look like someone</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.094" end="00:04:09.294" style="s2">who will get the job. My hands will not</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.894" end="00:04:10.794" style="s2">stop shaking. Then hold something. Where</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.294" end="00:04:13.494" style="s2">is your CV?</p>
<p begin="00:04:10.794" end="00:04:15.094" style="s2">Everything is here. Good. Remember, they</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.494" end="00:04:17.094" style="s2">are hiring someone skilled, not someone</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.094" end="00:04:18.394" style="s2">perfect. Speak slowly and look them in</p>
<p begin="00:04:17.094" end="00:04:20.594" style="s2">the eye.</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.394" end="00:04:22.694" style="s2">Thank you, Sharon. Without you, I would</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.594" end="00:04:24.694" style="s2">still be standing at that window. Go and</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.694" end="00:04:27.494" style="s2">bring me good news. I wish you all the</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.694" end="00:04:27.494" style="s2">luck in the world.</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.894" end="00:04:39.194" style="s2">Good morning, my dear Kingsley. Did you</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.994" end="00:04:41.294" style="s2">miss me?</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.194" end="00:04:43.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Glory, how did you get in?</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.294" end="00:04:44.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The guards still remember me. I brought</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.494" end="00:04:48.294" style="s2">you your favorite coffee.</p>
<p begin="00:04:44.994" end="00:04:50.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You left this company some time ago.</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.294" end="00:04:52.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I left the desk, not you. I know how</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.194" end="00:04:54.194" style="s2">heavy your week is. Board meeting on</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.094" end="00:04:55.294" style="s2">Thursday, lunch with Pauline on Friday,</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.194" end="00:04:57.294" style="s2">and Saturday morning you take the</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.294" end="00:04:58.694" style="s2">children shopping at the mall as always.</p>
<p begin="00:04:57.294" end="00:05:00.294" style="s2">I could come along to help you carry the</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.694" end="00:05:02.894" style="s2">bags.</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.294" end="00:05:04.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Glory, you are no longer a worker here.</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.894" end="00:05:07.294" style="s2">My Saturdays belong to my family.</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.994" end="00:05:09.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I only want to care for you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.294" end="00:05:11.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I appreciate the thought. Please take</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.294" end="00:05:13.694" style="s2">your coffee with you and shut the door</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.094" end="00:05:13.694" style="s2">on your way out.</p>
<p begin="00:05:21.394" end="00:05:24.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good morning, sir. I am here for the</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.994" end="00:05:26.494" style="s2">executive assistant interview. I will</p>
<p begin="00:05:24.894" end="00:05:29.394" style="s2">not leave until somebody tells me no</p>
<p begin="00:05:26.494" end="00:05:29.394" style="s2">with a signed paper.</p>
<p begin="00:05:32.743" end="00:05:34.763" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.894" end="00:05:41.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are the girl from the roadside, the</p>
<p begin="00:05:39.794" end="00:05:42.894" style="s2">one who refused my money.</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.394" end="00:05:44.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you are the man who wasted my one</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.894" end="00:05:46.594" style="s2">good dress. I am here to be paid for it,</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.894" end="00:05:48.294" style="s2">sir, but through work.</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.594" end="00:05:49.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy, I will be honest with you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.294" end="00:05:51.294" style="s2">Your qualifications are good, but I do</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.894" end="00:05:52.794" style="s2">not hire people who look at me the way</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.294" end="00:05:54.094" style="s2">you are looking at me now. This is a</p>
<p begin="00:05:52.794" end="00:05:56.694" style="s2">place of business, not a place for</p>
<p begin="00:05:54.094" end="00:05:56.694" style="s2">fantasies.</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.894" end="00:06:00.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chief, I am not here to pretend. I</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.594" end="00:06:01.994" style="s2">admire you and I will not lie about it,</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.694" end="00:06:04.294" style="s2">but I also know the difference between a</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.994" end="00:06:06.095" style="s2">job and a heart. Give me the job and</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.294" end="00:06:10.295" style="s2">judge me by my work. If I fail, you will</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.095" end="00:06:10.295" style="s2">send me away and I will carry no grudge.</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.795" end="00:06:18.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Report on Monday, 7 a.m. And Amy being</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.795" end="00:06:18.495" style="s2">late is the only sin I do not forgive.</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.249" end="00:06:21.269" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.109" end="00:06:29.129" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.729" end="00:06:31.749" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.095" end="00:06:36.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are back. How did it go?</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.495" end="00:06:40.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The man who interviewed me is the same</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.295" end="00:06:42.295" style="s2">man who splashed us with gutter water.</p>
<p begin="00:06:40.195" end="00:06:43.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seriously? You did not know it was his</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.295" end="00:06:45.495" style="s2">company?</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.295" end="00:06:46.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not at all. I almost turned around at</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.495" end="00:06:48.195" style="s2">the door.</p>
<p begin="00:06:46.295" end="00:06:51.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did he recognize you? Did he send you</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.195" end="00:06:51.295" style="s2">away because of that day?</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.795" end="00:06:57.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I got the job, Sharon. I start on</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.695" end="00:06:57.095" style="s2">Monday.</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.595" end="00:07:01.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy, this is wonderful. I knew you could</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.495" end="00:07:04.795" style="s2">do it.</p>
<p begin="00:07:01.595" end="00:07:06.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I still cannot believe it.</p>
<p begin="00:07:04.795" end="00:07:09.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Believe it. Now listen, this is your</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.795" end="00:07:10.895" style="s2">chance. Work hard, learn quickly, and</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.195" end="00:07:14.495" style="s2">let your skills speak for you.</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.895" end="00:07:14.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will, Sharon. I promise.</p>
<p begin="00:07:18.854" end="00:07:20.874" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.130" end="00:07:24.150" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.060" end="00:07:28.080" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:29.990" end="00:07:33.320" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:07:31.300" end="00:07:33.320" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.795" end="00:07:38.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good afternoon, Ma. You are the one</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.095" end="00:07:39.895" style="s2">Daddy talks about, the new assistant. He</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.595" end="00:07:41.395" style="s2">says you finished a month&#39;s work in two</p>
<p begin="00:07:39.895" end="00:07:43.195" style="s2">weeks. Please, can you help me with my</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.395" end="00:07:44.795" style="s2">chemistry? My teacher says I am lazy,</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.195" end="00:07:46.395" style="s2">but I think I am just confused.</p>
<p begin="00:07:44.795" end="00:07:48.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A confused boy and a lazy boy are</p>
<p begin="00:07:46.395" end="00:07:51.995" style="s2">different people, Toby. Confusion is</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.495" end="00:07:51.995" style="s2">curable. Bring the book.</p>
<p begin="00:07:52.915" end="00:07:54.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.795" end="00:08:04.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, I know exactly who you are. You</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.995" end="00:08:06.195" style="s2">are a girl who has found a rich old man</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.595" end="00:08:08.195" style="s2">and thinks she is clever.</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.195" end="00:08:09.297" style="s2">My father is grieving, not stupid. If</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.195" end="00:08:11.997" style="s2">you are here for his money, you are</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.297" end="00:08:11.997" style="s2">wasting your youth.</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.297" end="00:08:15.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zara, you speak well, and I respect a</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.897" end="00:08:17.397" style="s2">girl who says what is in her heart, so I</p>
<p begin="00:08:15.497" end="00:08:18.997" style="s2">will answer you the same way. I do not</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.397" end="00:08:20.797" style="s2">want your father&#39;s money. I have my own</p>
<p begin="00:08:18.997" end="00:08:22.297" style="s2">two hands. What I want is to know him,</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.797" end="00:08:23.997" style="s2">and I would never ever replace your</p>
<p begin="00:08:22.297" end="00:08:25.297" style="s2">mother. A person who has lost someone</p>
<p begin="00:08:23.997" end="00:08:27.797" style="s2">does not need a replacement. He needs</p>
<p begin="00:08:25.297" end="00:08:31.997" style="s2">company in his remembering.</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.797" end="00:08:31.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Talk is cheap, madam. We will see.</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.765" end="00:08:40.785" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [singing and music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:43.350" end="00:08:45.497" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:43.797" end="00:08:47.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chief, can I ask you something that is</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.497" end="00:08:48.597" style="s2">not about work?</p>
<p begin="00:08:47.097" end="00:08:51.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have been asking me things that are</p>
<p begin="00:08:48.597" end="00:08:53.597" style="s2">not about work since the day we met.</p>
<p begin="00:08:51.697" end="00:08:56.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why do you still wear that ring? Your</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.597" end="00:08:59.097" style="s2">wife is gone 4 years.</p>
<p begin="00:08:56.797" end="00:09:00.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because a ring is not for the dead, Amy.</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.097" end="00:09:02.197" style="s2">It is for the living.</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.497" end="00:09:04.297" style="s2">It reminds me of what love required of</p>
<p begin="00:09:02.197" end="00:09:05.697" style="s2">me, patience, [music] sacrifice, and</p>
<p begin="00:09:04.297" end="00:09:07.397" style="s2">honesty.</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.697" end="00:09:09.397" style="s2">When BC was sick, I promised her I would</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.397" end="00:09:10.697" style="s2">not let this house fall apart.</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.397" end="00:09:12.797" style="s2">I have kept that promise by keeping</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.697" end="00:09:15.097" style="s2">everything frozen, but frozen is not the</p>
<p begin="00:09:12.797" end="00:09:16.597" style="s2">same as alive.</p>
<p begin="00:09:15.097" end="00:09:19.497" style="s2">I think that is what my children see,</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.597" end="00:09:20.797" style="s2">and I do not know how to thaw.</p>
<p begin="00:09:19.497" end="00:09:22.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe thawing does not require</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.797" end="00:09:23.897" style="s2">forgetting, Chief.</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.397" end="00:09:27.236" style="s2">Maybe it only requires someone brave</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.897" end="00:09:29.256" style="s2">enough to stand in the cold with you.</p>
<p begin="00:09:27.236" end="00:09:29.256" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:39.797" end="00:09:43.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My brother has a new assistant, a small</p>
<p begin="00:09:41.897" end="00:09:46.297" style="s2">girl with big eyes. Toby&#39;s already</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.997" end="00:09:48.797" style="s2">calling her Auntie Amy. Even the driver</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.297" end="00:09:51.597" style="s2">says Kingsley smiles in the morning now.</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.797" end="00:09:52.797" style="s2">A man does not smile for no reason.</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.597" end="00:09:54.597" style="s2">Auntie, you are worried about a girl</p>
<p begin="00:09:52.797" end="00:09:55.797" style="s2">half my age?</p>
<p begin="00:09:54.597" end="00:09:57.197" style="s2">With respect, I have studied your</p>
<p begin="00:09:55.797" end="00:09:58.897" style="s2">brother for years. He admires</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.197" end="00:10:01.297" style="s2">intelligence and calm. I will simply</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.897" end="00:10:03.897" style="s2">remind him who I am.</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.297" end="00:10:06.197" style="s2">Do more than remind him. Cook for him,</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.897" end="00:10:07.697" style="s2">visit the house, win the children, and</p>
<p begin="00:10:06.197" end="00:10:09.998" style="s2">when the girl makes a mistake, we will</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.697" end="00:10:09.998" style="s2">be waiting.</p>
<p begin="00:10:17.098" end="00:10:21.098" style="s2">Chief, I made this myself as you like</p>
<p begin="00:10:18.898" end="00:10:22.798" style="s2">it. Peppery but not too much. A home</p>
<p begin="00:10:21.098" end="00:10:23.998" style="s2">needs a woman who remembers what her man</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.798" end="00:10:26.398" style="s2">likes.</p>
<p begin="00:10:23.998" end="00:10:27.898" style="s2">And you, my dear, what can you cook? Or</p>
<p begin="00:10:26.398" end="00:10:29.998" style="s2">did your mother only teach you how to</p>
<p begin="00:10:27.898" end="00:10:31.998" style="s2">talk?</p>
<p begin="00:10:29.998" end="00:10:34.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, my mother taught me many things.</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.998" end="00:10:35.698" style="s2">How to cook is one. How to hold my</p>
<p begin="00:10:34.198" end="00:10:36.798" style="s2">tongue when an elder is testing me is</p>
<p begin="00:10:35.698" end="00:10:38.198" style="s2">another.</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.798" end="00:10:39.798" style="s2">She also taught me that a woman&#39;s worth</p>
<p begin="00:10:38.198" end="00:10:41.907" style="s2">is not measured on a plate of rice, but</p>
<p begin="00:10:39.798" end="00:10:43.927" style="s2">I thank you for the question.</p>
<p begin="00:10:41.907" end="00:10:43.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:10:45.198" end="00:10:49.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young lady, you have a sharp mouth.</p>
<p begin="00:10:47.898" end="00:10:53.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And an honest heart, madam. Between the</p>
<p begin="00:10:49.898" end="00:10:53.098" style="s2">two, I choose to keep both.</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.972" end="00:10:58.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.898" end="00:11:04.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, Amy, you really meant what you said?</p>
<p begin="00:11:03.998" end="00:11:05.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; About what?</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.832" end="00:11:06.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:05.298" end="00:11:08.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t pretend you don&#39;t know what I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:11:06.398" end="00:11:10.998" style="s2">talking about. You mean this thing about</p>
<p begin="00:11:08.598" end="00:11:11.798" style="s2">Chief Kingsley? You actually love that</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.998" end="00:11:12.998" style="s2">man?</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.798" end="00:11:15.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.998" end="00:11:16.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy, you are serious?</p>
<p begin="00:11:15.198" end="00:11:18.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Very serious.</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.698" end="00:11:19.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are talking about Chief Kingsley,</p>
<p begin="00:11:18.398" end="00:11:20.998" style="s2">your boss.</p>
<p begin="00:11:19.698" end="00:11:23.098" style="s2">The man who is old enough to be your</p>
<p begin="00:11:20.998" end="00:11:24.498" style="s2">father. And [music] and you don&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.098" end="00:11:25.898" style="s2">know how old he really is. What if he is</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.498" end="00:11:27.598" style="s2">50? What if he is 60? The man already</p>
<p begin="00:11:25.898" end="00:11:28.898" style="s2">has two children. One is about 16 and</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.598" end="00:11:30.298" style="s2">the other is 15. Amy, have you thought</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.898" end="00:11:33.098" style="s2">about all these things?</p>
<p begin="00:11:30.298" end="00:11:34.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sharon, I have thought about them.</p>
<p begin="00:11:33.098" end="00:11:35.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you are still [music] saying you</p>
<p begin="00:11:34.298" end="00:11:37.098" style="s2">love him?</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.798" end="00:11:39.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:11:37.098" end="00:11:40.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I honestly don&#39;t understand you.</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.298" end="00:11:42.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t [music] have to understand me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:40.898" end="00:11:44.198" style="s2">I don&#39;t care how old he is. I don&#39;t care</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.698" end="00:11:45.398" style="s2">that he has children. I don&#39;t care what</p>
<p begin="00:11:44.198" end="00:11:47.698" style="s2">people will say.</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.398" end="00:11:50.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what do you care [music] about?</p>
<p begin="00:11:47.698" end="00:11:52.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The way I feel when I am around him.</p>
<p begin="00:11:50.298" end="00:11:54.198" style="s2">I told [music] you before, the first</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.098" end="00:11:55.098" style="s2">time I saw him, something happened to</p>
<p begin="00:11:54.198" end="00:11:56.898" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:55.098" end="00:11:58.398" style="s2">I fell in love with him.</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.898" end="00:12:00.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just like [music] that?</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.398" end="00:12:01.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just like that.</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.498" end="00:12:04.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you believe something will actually</p>
<p begin="00:12:01.998" end="00:12:06.698" style="s2">happen between both of you?</p>
<p begin="00:12:04.298" end="00:12:08.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I believe [music] we will marry.</p>
<p begin="00:12:06.698" end="00:12:10.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have already planned the wedding in</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.898" end="00:12:12.898" style="s2">your head?</p>
<p begin="00:12:10.298" end="00:12:12.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe.</p>
<p begin="00:12:24.899" end="00:12:27.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chief, I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:12:28.499" end="00:12:31.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s fine.</p>
<p begin="00:12:29.999" end="00:12:34.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m really sorry, chief.</p>
<p begin="00:12:31.899" end="00:12:34.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said it&#39;s fine.</p>
<p begin="00:12:35.499" end="00:12:38.599" style="s2">Amy.</p>
<p begin="00:12:37.299" end="00:12:39.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, chief.</p>
<p begin="00:12:38.599" end="00:12:41.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Commuting to work is difficult,</p>
<p begin="00:12:39.999" end="00:12:43.499" style="s2">especially with commercial vehicles. I</p>
<p begin="00:12:41.899" end="00:12:45.299" style="s2">do not like late coming.</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.499" end="00:12:48.099" style="s2">This is one of your benefits. Use it</p>
<p begin="00:12:45.299" end="00:12:50.699" style="s2">whenever you&#39;re commuting to work.</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.099" end="00:12:51.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chief, are you giving me a car?</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.699" end="00:12:52.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:12:51.999" end="00:12:56.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.999" end="00:12:56.299" style="s2">Thank you so much, chief.</p>
<p begin="00:13:04.199" end="00:13:05.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy.</p>
<p begin="00:13:05.353" end="00:13:08.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:05.699" end="00:13:08.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:13:08.899" end="00:13:14.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are really lucky, you know.</p>
<p begin="00:13:11.799" end="00:13:16.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucky?</p>
<p begin="00:13:14.299" end="00:13:18.399" style="s2">Yes. The way I am seeing things, it</p>
<p begin="00:13:16.199" end="00:13:20.299" style="s2">seems our boss is into you.</p>
<p begin="00:13:18.399" end="00:13:22.799" style="s2">If he&#39;s into me, you know, then I love</p>
<p begin="00:13:20.299" end="00:13:22.799" style="s2">it that way.</p>
<p begin="00:13:24.399" end="00:13:27.699" style="s2">What&#39;s wrong with her? Is she okay?</p>
<p begin="00:13:30.499" end="00:13:34.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So tell me.</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.899" end="00:13:34.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; About what?</p>
<p begin="00:13:37.499" end="00:13:39.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re funny.</p>
<p begin="00:13:38.759" end="00:13:42.089" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:13:39.399" end="00:13:42.089" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I try to be. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:43.344" end="00:13:45.364" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.799" end="00:13:59.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chief.</p>
<p begin="00:13:57.299" end="00:13:59.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.399" end="00:14:10.699" style="s2">May I come in, my princess?</p>
<p begin="00:14:12.499" end="00:14:14.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come in.</p>
<p begin="00:14:16.299" end="00:14:19.501" style="s2">Daddy, if you have come tell you are</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.701" end="00:14:21.901" style="s2">marrying Amy, please just say it</p>
<p begin="00:14:19.501" end="00:14:23.801" style="s2">quickly. I do not like surprises.</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.901" end="00:14:25.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zara, I have come to tell you the truth.</p>
<p begin="00:14:23.801" end="00:14:27.229" style="s2">I do not know what I am doing, but I</p>
<p begin="00:14:25.501" end="00:14:28.601" style="s2">want you to hear this from my own mouth.</p>
<p begin="00:14:27.229" end="00:14:29.901" style="s2">[music] If I ever love again, it will</p>
<p begin="00:14:28.601" end="00:14:31.601" style="s2">not be because I have stopped loving</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.901" end="00:14:33.801" style="s2">your mother.</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.601" end="00:14:36.101" style="s2">Love is not a room that gets full. It is</p>
<p begin="00:14:33.801" end="00:14:38.401" style="s2">a house with many rooms. Your mother has</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.101" end="00:14:40.201" style="s2">her room and it will never be touched.</p>
<p begin="00:14:38.401" end="00:14:41.501" style="s2">But a house with only one lit room is a</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.201" end="00:14:43.501" style="s2">very lonely house.</p>
<p begin="00:14:41.501" end="00:14:46.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, I am afraid [music] if a new</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.501" end="00:14:48.401" style="s2">woman comes, you will love us less.</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.301" end="00:14:50.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My child, no woman can ever take from</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.401" end="00:14:52.301" style="s2">you what belongs to you. Your place in</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.501" end="00:14:54.901" style="s2">my heart was signed and sealed the day</p>
<p begin="00:14:52.301" end="00:14:54.901" style="s2">you were born.</p>
<p begin="00:15:10.801" end="00:15:13.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kingsley.</p>
<p begin="00:15:12.301" end="00:15:16.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pauline.</p>
<p begin="00:15:13.501" end="00:15:16.101" style="s2">You&#39;re still here?</p>
<p begin="00:15:16.301" end="00:15:21.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kingsley.</p>
<p begin="00:15:17.901" end="00:15:21.401" style="s2">What did I hear about Amy and you?</p>
<p begin="00:15:22.501" end="00:15:25.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you talking about?</p>
<p begin="00:15:24.201" end="00:15:27.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t pretend you don&#39;t know what I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:15:25.601" end="00:15:30.801" style="s2">talking about. [music] What&#39;s going on</p>
<p begin="00:15:27.901" end="00:15:30.801" style="s2">between you two?</p>
<p begin="00:15:33.701" end="00:15:36.901" style="s2">I thought [music] she was the one trying</p>
<p begin="00:15:34.801" end="00:15:39.201" style="s2">to take advantage of you. I thought she</p>
<p begin="00:15:36.901" end="00:15:41.701" style="s2">was the one looking for an opportunity.</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.201" end="00:15:44.101" style="s2">But now I see you are into her.</p>
<p begin="00:15:41.701" end="00:15:46.001" style="s2">What&#39;s going on, Kingsley?</p>
<p begin="00:15:44.101" end="00:15:47.701" style="s2">That girl is a small girl.</p>
<p begin="00:15:46.001" end="00:15:49.101" style="s2">She&#39;s almost your daughter&#39;s age. What&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:15:47.701" end="00:15:51.001" style="s2">going on?</p>
<p begin="00:15:49.101" end="00:15:52.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pauline, I I I don&#39;t know what is wrong</p>
<p begin="00:15:51.001" end="00:15:54.601" style="s2">with me.</p>
<p begin="00:15:52.501" end="00:15:57.001" style="s2">I just don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:15:54.601" end="00:15:58.201" style="s2">I don&#39;t want to betray BC.</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.001" end="00:16:00.101" style="s2">But on the other hand, there&#39;s something</p>
<p begin="00:15:58.201" end="00:16:01.901" style="s2">about Amy that I [music] can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:16:00.101" end="00:16:04.101" style="s2">I can&#39;t get my head off.</p>
<p begin="00:16:01.901" end="00:16:05.901" style="s2">I can&#39;t stop thinking about her.</p>
<p begin="00:16:04.101" end="00:16:08.401" style="s2">Whenever I&#39;m with her,</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.901" end="00:16:10.001" style="s2">I feel relaxed. I feel happy.</p>
<p begin="00:16:08.401" end="00:16:11.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kingsley,</p>
<p begin="00:16:10.001" end="00:16:14.201" style="s2">you are in love with that girl.</p>
<p begin="00:16:11.901" end="00:16:14.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:16:16.601" end="00:16:21.102" style="s2">That can&#39;t be.</p>
<p begin="00:16:18.301" end="00:16:23.102" style="s2">That girl is still a small girl.</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.102" end="00:16:24.902" style="s2">I even call her my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.102" end="00:16:26.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And yet you cannot stop thinking about</p>
<p begin="00:16:24.902" end="00:16:29.002" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="00:16:26.002" end="00:16:32.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know what is happening to me.</p>
<p begin="00:16:29.002" end="00:16:32.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You need to be careful, Kingsley.</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.266" end="00:16:39.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:37.702" end="00:16:41.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy, I need to speak to you plainly.</p>
<p begin="00:16:39.302" end="00:16:43.202" style="s2">People are talking. I am 50 years old.</p>
<p begin="00:16:41.402" end="00:16:44.202" style="s2">You are 25. When I was learning to walk,</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.202" end="00:16:46.302" style="s2">your mother was probably still in</p>
<p begin="00:16:44.202" end="00:16:48.202" style="s2">secondary school. This cannot happen.</p>
<p begin="00:16:46.302" end="00:16:51.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chief, with the greatest respect, you</p>
<p begin="00:16:48.202" end="00:16:52.902" style="s2">keep saying cannot when you mean afraid.</p>
<p begin="00:16:51.102" end="00:16:54.602" style="s2">Let me ask you one question.</p>
<p begin="00:16:52.902" end="00:16:56.302" style="s2">Do you want me to leave this company?</p>
<p begin="00:16:54.602" end="00:16:59.902" style="s2">Say yes and I will clean my desk this</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.302" end="00:16:59.902" style="s2">evening and never trouble you again.</p>
<p begin="00:17:01.202" end="00:17:04.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay.</p>
<p begin="00:17:02.702" end="00:17:06.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then allow me to teach you something my</p>
<p begin="00:17:04.202" end="00:17:07.902" style="s2">grandmother taught me.</p>
<p begin="00:17:06.102" end="00:17:09.802" style="s2">Age is only the number of times the sun</p>
<p begin="00:17:07.902" end="00:17:11.602" style="s2">has risen on your head.</p>
<p begin="00:17:09.802" end="00:17:13.402" style="s2">It says nothing about how many mornings</p>
<p begin="00:17:11.602" end="00:17:15.702" style="s2">your heart has left.</p>
<p begin="00:17:13.402" end="00:17:18.102" style="s2">You are not too old to be loved, Chief.</p>
<p begin="00:17:15.702" end="00:17:19.802" style="s2">You are only too careful.</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.102" end="00:17:21.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe love is [singing] just</p>
<p begin="00:17:19.802" end="00:17:26.102" style="s2">this</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.502" end="00:17:31.202" style="s2">sitting here beside you, feeling safe in</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.102" end="00:17:33.702" style="s2">your arms. Stay with me tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:17:31.202" end="00:17:33.702" style="s2">Don&#39;t say a word.</p>
<p begin="00:17:34.102" end="00:17:37.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I spoke to Kingsley.</p>
<p begin="00:17:36.102" end="00:17:39.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did he say?</p>
<p begin="00:17:37.702" end="00:17:40.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s true.</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.102" end="00:17:43.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is true?</p>
<p begin="00:17:40.602" end="00:17:46.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There is something between him and Amy.</p>
<p begin="00:17:43.402" end="00:17:46.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What does Kingsley want?</p>
<p begin="00:17:47.502" end="00:17:50.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What would he be doing with a small</p>
<p begin="00:17:48.802" end="00:17:53.402" style="s2">girl?</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.202" end="00:17:55.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have loved him for years.</p>
<p begin="00:17:53.402" end="00:17:59.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Years, auntie.</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.302" end="00:18:02.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And yet he chooses a small girl over me.</p>
<p begin="00:17:59.102" end="00:18:04.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you must do something about it.</p>
<p begin="00:18:02.802" end="00:18:06.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you want me to do?</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.402" end="00:18:08.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We make Kingsley believe Amy is not who</p>
<p begin="00:18:06.202" end="00:18:09.602" style="s2">she says she is. We will set her up.</p>
<p begin="00:18:08.702" end="00:18:11.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How?</p>
<p begin="00:18:09.602" end="00:18:13.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We don&#39;t need to hurt her.</p>
<p begin="00:18:11.402" end="00:18:15.502" style="s2">We only need to give Kingsley a reason</p>
<p begin="00:18:13.102" end="00:18:18.502" style="s2">to chase her away from the company.</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.502" end="00:18:20.503" style="s2">Glory, you will handle the setup.</p>
<p begin="00:18:18.502" end="00:18:24.303" style="s2">But no matter what you</p>
<p begin="00:18:20.503" end="00:18:24.303" style="s2">do not harm my brother.</p>
<p begin="00:18:30.503" end="00:18:33.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello.</p>
<p begin="00:18:31.903" end="00:18:36.203" style="s2">Amy.</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.703" end="00:18:36.203" style="s2">Yes?</p>
<p begin="00:18:36.703" end="00:18:39.903" style="s2">I&#39;ve heard a lot about you.</p>
<p begin="00:18:40.603" end="00:18:45.103" style="s2">I hope they said good things.</p>
<p begin="00:18:42.703" end="00:18:46.903" style="s2">That depends on who you ask.</p>
<p begin="00:18:45.103" end="00:18:50.003" style="s2">Then you should ask me.</p>
<p begin="00:18:46.903" end="00:18:51.403" style="s2">You seem very confident. I have to be.</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.003" end="00:18:53.403" style="s2">I&#39;ve heard about your relationship with</p>
<p begin="00:18:51.403" end="00:18:56.103" style="s2">Kingsley. My relationship with Chief?</p>
<p begin="00:18:53.403" end="00:18:58.003" style="s2">Yes. And what exactly did you hear? That</p>
<p begin="00:18:56.103" end="00:19:00.203" style="s2">you have become very close to him. I</p>
<p begin="00:18:58.003" end="00:19:01.903" style="s2">work for him. Is that all? If you came</p>
<p begin="00:19:00.203" end="00:19:03.803" style="s2">here looking for a different answer, I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:19:01.903" end="00:19:06.603" style="s2">afraid I don&#39;t have one for you. You are</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.803" end="00:19:08.603" style="s2">quite sharp. Only when necessary. You</p>
<p begin="00:19:06.603" end="00:19:10.303" style="s2">know, I didn&#39;t come here to fight with</p>
<p begin="00:19:08.603" end="00:19:11.903" style="s2">you. I only wanted to meet the young</p>
<p begin="00:19:10.303" end="00:19:14.903" style="s2">woman everyone seems to be talking</p>
<p begin="00:19:11.903" end="00:19:16.803" style="s2">about. Well, now you&#39;ve met me.</p>
<p begin="00:19:14.903" end="00:19:18.803" style="s2">Yes, I have.</p>
<p begin="00:19:16.803" end="00:19:21.603" style="s2">Actually, I wanted to ask you something.</p>
<p begin="00:19:18.803" end="00:19:24.003" style="s2">What? Can I have your account number?</p>
<p begin="00:19:21.603" end="00:19:26.103" style="s2">My account number? Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:19:24.003" end="00:19:28.603" style="s2">Okay. You want to dash me money?</p>
<p begin="00:19:26.103" end="00:19:30.203" style="s2">Something like that. Fine. I don&#39;t hide</p>
<p begin="00:19:28.603" end="00:19:31.303" style="s2">my account number.</p>
<p begin="00:19:30.203" end="00:19:33.803" style="s2">There.</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.303" end="00:19:33.803" style="s2">Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:19:36.103" end="00:19:39.703" style="s2">You don&#39;t know what&#39;s coming for you.</p>
<p begin="00:19:44.703" end="00:19:47.903" style="s2">I&#39;m telling you, Amy. Some men don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:19:46.403" end="00:19:49.703" style="s2">know how to behave.</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.903" end="00:19:52.403" style="s2">You are talking as if you have dated</p>
<p begin="00:19:49.703" end="00:19:54.503" style="s2">every man in Abuja. I don&#39;t need to date</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.403" end="00:19:55.803" style="s2">every man to know men. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.503" end="00:19:57.803" style="s2">What happened?</p>
<p begin="00:19:55.803" end="00:20:00.603" style="s2">Wow. What?</p>
<p begin="00:19:57.803" end="00:20:03.103" style="s2">I just received 5 million naira. 5</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.603" end="00:20:05.703" style="s2">million? [music] Are you for real?</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.103" end="00:20:07.303" style="s2">Like a whole 5 million naira from where?</p>
<p begin="00:20:05.703" end="00:20:09.798" style="s2">I don&#39;t know. Did you give anybody your</p>
<p begin="00:20:07.303" end="00:20:12.303" style="s2">account? I remember giving Glory. Glory?</p>
<p begin="00:20:09.798" end="00:20:15.603" style="s2">[music] Yes. Who is Glory?</p>
<p begin="00:20:12.303" end="00:20:17.303" style="s2">She&#39;s someone close to Chief. Hmm.</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.603" end="00:20:18.903" style="s2">Very suspicious.</p>
<p begin="00:20:17.303" end="00:20:20.803" style="s2">What do you mean? You just told me you</p>
<p begin="00:20:18.903" end="00:20:22.403" style="s2">gave this woman your account number, and</p>
<p begin="00:20:20.803" end="00:20:24.305" style="s2">now [music] 5 million naira has entered</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.403" end="00:20:25.805" style="s2">your account.</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.305" end="00:20:27.505" style="s2">Maybe she&#39;s the one that sent you the</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.805" end="00:20:29.705" style="s2">money to leave Chief.</p>
<p begin="00:20:27.505" end="00:20:31.705" style="s2">That&#39;s never going to happen. If so, I</p>
<p begin="00:20:29.705" end="00:20:33.505" style="s2">will resend the money to her. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:20:31.705" end="00:20:35.905" style="s2">But for now, I don&#39;t know who sent the</p>
<p begin="00:20:33.505" end="00:20:39.605" style="s2">money. Then don&#39;t touch it until you</p>
<p begin="00:20:35.905" end="00:20:39.605" style="s2">know. I wasn&#39;t planning to.</p>
<p begin="00:20:48.305" end="00:20:53.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kingsley, I will not mince words. Your</p>
<p begin="00:20:50.505" end="00:20:54.905" style="s2">assistant is a thief and a liar. Glory,</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.105" end="00:20:56.705" style="s2">show him.</p>
<p begin="00:20:54.905" end="00:20:58.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chief, these are bank records showing</p>
<p begin="00:20:56.705" end="00:20:59.905" style="s2">that 5 million naira was transferred</p>
<p begin="00:20:58.405" end="00:21:01.705" style="s2">from your company account to a personal</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.905" end="00:21:04.605" style="s2">account 3 weeks ago. The account [music]</p>
<p begin="00:21:01.705" end="00:21:04.605" style="s2">belongs to Amy.</p>
<p begin="00:21:06.905" end="00:21:10.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chief, I swear to you, I do not know</p>
<p begin="00:21:08.505" end="00:21:12.405" style="s2">anything about this. I have never moved</p>
<p begin="00:21:10.305" end="00:21:14.305" style="s2">a kobo from this company. You see, a</p>
<p begin="00:21:12.405" end="00:21:18.205" style="s2">girl with nothing who suddenly clings to</p>
<p begin="00:21:14.305" end="00:21:18.205" style="s2">a billionaire. We must call the police.</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.005" end="00:21:24.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy, is this your account number?</p>
<p begin="00:21:21.905" end="00:21:25.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is, but Chief, I did not do it.</p>
<p begin="00:21:24.005" end="00:21:27.005" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:21:25.105" end="00:21:29.505" style="s2">I gave you every day of my life these</p>
<p begin="00:21:27.005" end="00:21:31.905" style="s2">past months. You know me.</p>
<p begin="00:21:29.505" end="00:21:36.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leave my office. Until this matter is</p>
<p begin="00:21:31.905" end="00:21:36.005" style="s2">investigated, you are suspended.</p>
<p begin="00:21:37.205" end="00:21:43.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chief, a man who loves truth does not</p>
<p begin="00:21:39.605" end="00:21:44.605" style="s2">need a loud accuser. He needs patience.</p>
<p begin="00:21:43.005" end="00:21:47.305" style="s2">I only pray you will find yours before</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.605" end="00:21:47.305" style="s2">you lose me.</p>
<p begin="00:21:50.015" end="00:21:52.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:21:52.105" end="00:21:55.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy, you have cried enough. I know this</p>
<p begin="00:21:54.305" end="00:21:57.505" style="s2">hurts, [music] but we need to think</p>
<p begin="00:21:55.405" end="00:21:59.705" style="s2">clearly now. The 5 million naira is the</p>
<p begin="00:21:57.505" end="00:22:01.205" style="s2">key to everything that has happened.</p>
<p begin="00:21:59.705" end="00:22:02.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know, [music] but I still cannot</p>
<p begin="00:22:01.205" end="00:22:04.505" style="s2">understand how this has turned against</p>
<p begin="00:22:02.705" end="00:22:06.205" style="s2">me. Glory was the one who asked for my</p>
<p begin="00:22:04.505" end="00:22:07.605" style="s2">account number. She told me she wanted</p>
<p begin="00:22:06.205" end="00:22:08.905" style="s2">to give me some money, so I gave it to</p>
<p begin="00:22:07.605" end="00:22:10.905" style="s2">her. [music] Then the 5 million naira</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.905" end="00:22:12.305" style="s2">came in. And I was sitting right beside</p>
<p begin="00:22:10.905" end="00:22:13.505" style="s2">you when you received the alert. We both</p>
<p begin="00:22:12.305" end="00:22:14.505" style="s2">wondered where the money came from, but</p>
<p begin="00:22:13.505" end="00:22:16.105" style="s2">you had no reason to think it was</p>
<p begin="00:22:14.505" end="00:22:18.205" style="s2">connected to [music] Chief&#39;s company.</p>
<p begin="00:22:16.105" end="00:22:20.105" style="s2">Exactly. I never knew that money came</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.205" end="00:22:22.105" style="s2">from the company. I never asked Glory to</p>
<p begin="00:22:20.105" end="00:22:23.705" style="s2">send me 5 million naira. And now Chief</p>
<p begin="00:22:22.105" end="00:22:24.705" style="s2">thinks I took it from him. That&#39;s what</p>
<p begin="00:22:23.705" end="00:22:26.006" style="s2">bothers me. [music] Glory had your</p>
<p begin="00:22:24.705" end="00:22:27.206" style="s2">account number because you gave it to</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.006" end="00:22:29.106" style="s2">her. She sent the money into your</p>
<p begin="00:22:27.206" end="00:22:30.406" style="s2">account. Then somehow the same money</p>
<p begin="00:22:29.106" end="00:22:31.506" style="s2">becomes evidence that you stole from the</p>
<p begin="00:22:30.406" end="00:22:33.906" style="s2">company.</p>
<p begin="00:22:31.506" end="00:22:34.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think she did this deliberately?</p>
<p begin="00:22:33.906" end="00:22:37.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know why she would [music] do</p>
<p begin="00:22:34.906" end="00:22:39.206" style="s2">it, but too many things connect.</p>
<p begin="00:22:37.306" end="00:22:41.206" style="s2">She asked for your account number. The</p>
<p begin="00:22:39.206" end="00:22:44.606" style="s2">money came from her, [music] and now you</p>
<p begin="00:22:41.206" end="00:22:44.606" style="s2">are the one being blamed for it.</p>
<p begin="00:22:45.690" end="00:22:48.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:22:47.006" end="00:22:49.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we need to find out where that</p>
<p begin="00:22:48.206" end="00:22:52.006" style="s2">money really came from.</p>
<p begin="00:22:49.706" end="00:22:53.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, because if we can prove that Glory</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.006" end="00:22:54.806" style="s2">was the one who sent it, we may finally</p>
<p begin="00:22:53.550" end="00:22:59.006" style="s2">[music] have something that can clear</p>
<p begin="00:22:54.806" end="00:22:59.006" style="s2">your name. Then let&#39;s find the proof.</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.606" end="00:23:12.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zara, I do not believe it. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.806" end="00:23:14.506" style="s2">Auntie Amy would not steal. She taught</p>
<p begin="00:23:12.906" end="00:23:17.006" style="s2">me chemistry. She gave me our own lunch</p>
<p begin="00:23:14.506" end="00:23:19.096" style="s2">when I forgot mine.</p>
<p begin="00:23:17.006" end="00:23:20.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Toby, I was wrong about her. I have been</p>
<p begin="00:23:19.096" end="00:23:22.606" style="s2">[music] watching. She never once asked</p>
<p begin="00:23:20.806" end="00:23:24.206" style="s2">Daddy for money. When Auntie Pauline</p>
<p begin="00:23:22.606" end="00:23:26.306" style="s2">tried to insult her, she answered with</p>
<p begin="00:23:24.206" end="00:23:29.306" style="s2">respect. [music] A thief does not behave</p>
<p begin="00:23:26.306" end="00:23:31.906" style="s2">like that, and Daddy needs to know.</p>
<p begin="00:23:29.306" end="00:23:34.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But how? He is so angry.</p>
<p begin="00:23:31.906" end="00:23:36.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Remember, Auntie Pauline&#39;s driver once</p>
<p begin="00:23:34.206" end="00:23:38.206" style="s2">told us Auntie Glory visits a friend at</p>
<p begin="00:23:36.106" end="00:23:41.306" style="s2">the bank every Tuesday.</p>
<p begin="00:23:38.206" end="00:23:41.306" style="s2">I think we should [music] follow her.</p>
<p begin="00:23:51.706" end="00:23:54.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here.</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.006" end="00:24:05.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just as I instructed, the transfer</p>
<p begin="00:24:04.706" end="00:24:07.406" style="s2">record must show that her account</p>
<p begin="00:24:05.906" end="00:24:09.806" style="s2">received the money. Nobody must check</p>
<p begin="00:24:07.406" end="00:24:12.206" style="s2">the device log.</p>
<p begin="00:24:09.806" end="00:24:12.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got you.</p>
<p begin="00:24:17.906" end="00:24:20.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you see how Amy was defending</p>
<p begin="00:24:19.306" end="00:24:21.606" style="s2">herself?</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.506" end="00:24:23.506" style="s2">She doesn&#39;t know she&#39;s too small to</p>
<p begin="00:24:21.606" end="00:24:25.706" style="s2">compete with me.</p>
<p begin="00:24:23.506" end="00:24:28.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Glory, you must do everything possible</p>
<p begin="00:24:25.706" end="00:24:28.807" style="s2">to make Kingsley you.</p>
<p begin="00:24:32.807" end="00:24:35.607" style="s2">What is this? A thief in my brother&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:24:34.807" end="00:24:37.408" style="s2">house?</p>
<p begin="00:24:35.607" end="00:24:38.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is going on here?</p>
<p begin="00:24:37.408" end="00:24:41.707" style="s2">Pauline, [music] please.</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.607" end="00:24:41.707" style="s2">Amy, you have five minutes.</p>
<p begin="00:24:43.408" end="00:24:46.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just [music] as I instructed, the</p>
<p begin="00:24:44.707" end="00:24:48.107" style="s2">transfer record must show that her</p>
<p begin="00:24:46.107" end="00:24:51.007" style="s2">account received the money. Nobody must</p>
<p begin="00:24:48.107" end="00:24:51.007" style="s2">check the device log.</p>
<p begin="00:24:52.107" end="00:24:56.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chief, I I did it because I love you.</p>
<p begin="00:24:54.408" end="00:24:57.807" style="s2">Madam Pauline said you needed a wife. I</p>
<p begin="00:24:56.107" end="00:24:59.707" style="s2">only wanted you to see me.</p>
<p begin="00:24:57.807" end="00:25:01.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Glory, you did not love me. You loved</p>
<p begin="00:24:59.707" end="00:25:02.307" style="s2">what I could give you.</p>
<p begin="00:25:01.007" end="00:25:04.007" style="s2">Real love does not frame an innocent</p>
<p begin="00:25:02.307" end="00:25:06.408" style="s2">girl. Real love does not need a lie to</p>
<p begin="00:25:04.007" end="00:25:07.707" style="s2">survive.</p>
<p begin="00:25:06.408" end="00:25:08.908" style="s2">And you, Pauline, you are my elder</p>
<p begin="00:25:07.707" end="00:25:10.207" style="s2">sister. I respect you more than I can</p>
<p begin="00:25:08.908" end="00:25:11.507" style="s2">say, but you have used my grief as a</p>
<p begin="00:25:10.207" end="00:25:13.107" style="s2">weapon. You pushed me toward a woman who</p>
<p begin="00:25:11.507" end="00:25:15.007" style="s2">was not mine to choose.</p>
<p begin="00:25:13.107" end="00:25:16.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kingsley, I was only afraid for you.</p>
<p begin="00:25:15.007" end="00:25:18.607" style="s2">After Bisi died, you were a ghost. I</p>
<p begin="00:25:16.707" end="00:25:20.607" style="s2">wanted you to live again. I chose</p>
<p begin="00:25:18.607" end="00:25:22.408" style="s2">wrongly, but I chose out of love.</p>
<p begin="00:25:20.607" end="00:25:24.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Love without wisdom can do as much harm</p>
<p begin="00:25:22.408" end="00:25:25.807" style="s2">as hatred, my sister.</p>
<p begin="00:25:24.307" end="00:25:28.507" style="s2">Next time, ask me what my heart needs</p>
<p begin="00:25:25.807" end="00:25:30.307" style="s2">before you send me a woman.</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.507" end="00:25:33.707" style="s2">Glory, leave my house</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.307" end="00:25:33.707" style="s2">and never show your face here again.</p>
<p begin="00:25:46.472" end="00:25:48.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:25:50.207" end="00:25:55.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay with me.</p>
<p begin="00:25:53.677" end="00:25:55.697" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:25:57.207" end="00:26:00.107" style="s2">I don&#39;t need a thousand</p>
<p begin="00:25:58.507" end="00:26:01.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy, I owe you an apology that no</p>
<p begin="00:26:00.107" end="00:26:02.908" style="s2">envelope can pay.</p>
<p begin="00:26:01.507" end="00:26:05.507" style="s2">I doubted you.</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.908" end="00:26:08.007" style="s2">In my fear, I chose the wrong silence.</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.507" end="00:26:09.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chief, I forgave you before you asked.</p>
<p begin="00:26:08.007" end="00:26:10.708" style="s2">A person who truly loves does not keep a</p>
<p begin="00:26:09.707" end="00:26:11.363" style="s2">list of wrongs.</p>
<p begin="00:26:10.708" end="00:26:13.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:26:11.363" end="00:26:14.707" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:26:13.307" end="00:26:16.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My children asked me what I wanted. I</p>
<p begin="00:26:14.707" end="00:26:18.107" style="s2">told them a house with many rooms, a</p>
<p begin="00:26:16.507" end="00:26:20.307" style="s2">table with laughter, and a woman who is</p>
<p begin="00:26:18.107" end="00:26:22.107" style="s2">brave enough to sit at it.</p>
<p begin="00:26:20.307" end="00:26:23.908" style="s2">Amy, you came into my life through a</p>
<p begin="00:26:22.107" end="00:26:25.773" style="s2">splash of dirty water, and you have</p>
<p begin="00:26:23.908" end="00:26:28.607" style="s2">washed away four years of sorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:26:25.773" end="00:26:30.809" style="s2">[music] Will you marry me?</p>
<p begin="00:26:28.607" end="00:26:34.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Auntie Amy, say yes. I have already told</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.809" end="00:26:34.009" style="s2">the whole school you are my stepmother.</p>
<p begin="00:26:39.009" end="00:26:43.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, chief. A thousand times, yes.</p>
<p begin="00:26:47.388" end="00:26:51.373" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:26:49.353" end="00:26:51.373" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.628" end="00:26:54.648" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:26:58.709" end="00:27:03.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, you are the elder of this house.</p>
<p begin="00:27:01.609" end="00:27:04.809" style="s2">I would be honored if you stood beside</p>
<p begin="00:27:03.209" end="00:27:05.709" style="s2">me at the wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:27:04.809" end="00:27:07.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Child, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:27:05.709" end="00:27:09.409" style="s2">you have a sharp mouth and a bigger</p>
<p begin="00:27:07.309" end="00:27:12.509" style="s2">heart than I deserve to see.</p>
<p begin="00:27:09.409" end="00:27:12.509" style="s2">Welcome to the family.</p>
<p begin="00:27:14.243" end="00:27:16.263" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:27:20.793" end="00:27:22.813" style="s2">[music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.929" end="00:27:35.209" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:27:33.238" end="00:27:36.909" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:27:35.209" end="00:27:39.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We are gathered here today to witness</p>
<p begin="00:27:36.909" end="00:27:40.509" style="s2">the union of Amy and Kingsley in</p>
<p begin="00:27:39.009" end="00:27:42.709" style="s2">marriage.</p>
<p begin="00:27:40.509" end="00:27:44.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chief, when I met you, I never imagined</p>
<p begin="00:27:42.709" end="00:27:45.709" style="s2">that the road that brought us together</p>
<p begin="00:27:44.109" end="00:27:49.809" style="s2">would lead me here.</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.709" end="00:27:49.809" style="s2">Today, I choose you with all my heart.</p>
<p begin="00:27:49.909" end="00:27:54.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy, you brought happiness back into my</p>
<p begin="00:27:51.609" end="00:27:56.109" style="s2">home and love back into my heart. Today,</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.309" end="00:27:58.509" style="s2">tomorrow, and for the rest of my life, I</p>
<p begin="00:27:56.109" end="00:27:58.509" style="s2">choose you.</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.059" end="00:28:04.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:28:05.309" end="00:28:10.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; By the authority vested in me, I</p>
<p begin="00:28:07.209" end="00:28:10.709" style="s2">pronounce you husband and wife.</p>
<p begin="00:28:11.229" end="00:28:13.249" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="00:28:15.209" end="00:28:19.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy, look at you. My best friend is</p>
<p begin="00:28:17.609" end="00:28:20.309" style="s2">finally a married woman.</p>
<p begin="00:28:19.744" end="00:28:22.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:28:20.309" end="00:28:24.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy, welcome to our family. I&#39;m happy to</p>
<p begin="00:28:22.509" end="00:28:25.809" style="s2">see my brother this happy.</p>
<p begin="00:28:24.309" end="00:28:29.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Madam Pauline. I&#39;m happy to</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.809" end="00:28:29.109" style="s2">be part of the family.</p>
<p begin="00:28:32.189" end="00:28:34.864" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:28:32.844" end="00:28:34.864" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:28:42.014" end="00:28:44.034" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:28:48.410" end="00:28:51.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chief, I think the road is blessing us</p>
<p begin="00:28:50.210" end="00:28:52.810" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:28:51.310" end="00:28:55.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My dear, this time I will carry the</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.810" end="00:28:57.134" style="s2">umbrella and you carry the joy.</p>
<p begin="00:28:55.114" end="00:28:57.134" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.734" end="00:28:59.754" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:29:03.630" end="00:29:05.650" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:29:16.730" end="00:29:18.750" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:29:24.010" end="00:29:27.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good morning, mummy Amy. This jollof is</p>
<p begin="00:29:25.710" end="00:29:28.810" style="s2">really delicious. Thank you for cooking</p>
<p begin="00:29:27.210" end="00:29:30.610" style="s2">for us.</p>
<p begin="00:29:28.810" end="00:29:32.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are welcome, Toby.</p>
<p begin="00:29:30.610" end="00:29:33.510" style="s2">Zara, are you okay? You have not touched</p>
<p begin="00:29:32.110" end="00:29:35.510" style="s2">your food.</p>
<p begin="00:29:33.510" end="00:29:38.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am fine, Amy. I am just thinking about</p>
<p begin="00:29:35.510" end="00:29:38.110" style="s2">my exam.</p>
<p begin="00:29:43.710" end="00:29:47.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good morning, my family.</p>
<p begin="00:29:45.510" end="00:29:48.910" style="s2">Amy, tonight is the anniversary gala of</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.010" end="00:29:49.710" style="s2">the company. Many important people will</p>
<p begin="00:29:48.910" end="00:29:51.810" style="s2">come.</p>
<p begin="00:29:49.710" end="00:29:53.110" style="s2">I want you beside me, not behind me. You</p>
<p begin="00:29:51.810" end="00:29:54.110" style="s2">are my wife and you will stand where a</p>
<p begin="00:29:53.110" end="00:29:55.910" style="s2">wife stands.</p>
<p begin="00:29:54.110" end="00:29:58.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will be there, my love, and I will not</p>
<p begin="00:29:55.910" end="00:30:01.310" style="s2">shrink for anybody.</p>
<p begin="00:29:58.610" end="00:30:02.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is why I married you.</p>
<p begin="00:30:01.310" end="00:30:04.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My daughter, I brought you soup. You</p>
<p begin="00:30:02.710" end="00:30:06.010" style="s2">look tired. Sit down.</p>
<p begin="00:30:04.310" end="00:30:07.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am not the woman I used to be, Amy. I</p>
<p begin="00:30:06.010" end="00:30:09.410" style="s2">treated you badly and I will spend the</p>
<p begin="00:30:07.510" end="00:30:10.910" style="s2">rest of my life correcting it. A family</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.410" end="00:30:13.310" style="s2">is not built by choosing who deserves to</p>
<p begin="00:30:10.910" end="00:30:14.610" style="s2">enter. It is built by those who stay.</p>
<p begin="00:30:13.310" end="00:30:18.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Auntie Pauline, you have already</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.610" end="00:30:18.010" style="s2">corrected it. Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.610" end="00:30:21.630" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.230" end="00:30:24.250" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:30:31.401" end="00:30:33.421" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:30:34.912" end="00:30:37.351" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, yeah, yeah. [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:30:37.412" end="00:30:42.712" style="s2">My baby. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:30:39.712" end="00:30:42.712" style="s2">Come closer.</p>
<p begin="00:30:45.811" end="00:30:48.112" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:30:46.612" end="00:30:50.212" style="s2">When you look into my</p>
<p begin="00:30:48.112" end="00:30:54.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that the girl? She looks like his</p>
<p begin="00:30:50.212" end="00:30:54.512" style="s2">daughter. Money is a powerful thing.</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.512" end="00:31:01.912" style="s2">Good evening, ma. I am Amy Kingsley&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.412" end="00:31:04.012" style="s2">wife. I heard you wondering about me.</p>
<p begin="00:31:01.912" end="00:31:06.112" style="s2">You can ask me directly. I do not bite.</p>
<p begin="00:31:04.012" end="00:31:08.212" style="s2">My dear, I will be honest. You are 25.</p>
<p begin="00:31:06.112" end="00:31:10.312" style="s2">He is 50. People are asking what a young</p>
<p begin="00:31:08.212" end="00:31:11.612" style="s2">girl wants from an old man. Is it love</p>
<p begin="00:31:10.312" end="00:31:13.712" style="s2">or is it the house, the cars, and the</p>
<p begin="00:31:11.612" end="00:31:15.512" style="s2">bank account?</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.712" end="00:31:16.912" style="s2">Ma, I understand your question because I</p>
<p begin="00:31:15.512" end="00:31:18.012" style="s2">know how the world looks at us, but let</p>
<p begin="00:31:16.912" end="00:31:19.912" style="s2">me answer.</p>
<p begin="00:31:18.012" end="00:31:22.012" style="s2">I did not meet Kingsley&#39;s money first. I</p>
<p begin="00:31:19.912" end="00:31:24.212" style="s2">met his kindness. When I was a nobody,</p>
<p begin="00:31:22.012" end="00:31:25.612" style="s2">he was the only one who listened to me</p>
<p begin="00:31:24.212" end="00:31:27.512" style="s2">If it was money I wanted, I would have</p>
<p begin="00:31:25.612" end="00:31:29.612" style="s2">chosen a man who spoils me with gifts</p>
<p begin="00:31:27.512" end="00:31:32.112" style="s2">and shouts at me in private.</p>
<p begin="00:31:29.612" end="00:31:34.312" style="s2">I chose a man who respects me.</p>
<p begin="00:31:32.112" end="00:31:35.812" style="s2">Age counts the years we have lived. It</p>
<p begin="00:31:34.312" end="00:31:38.112" style="s2">does not count the love we are able to</p>
<p begin="00:31:35.812" end="00:31:39.912" style="s2">give.</p>
<p begin="00:31:38.112" end="00:31:42.912" style="s2">Kingsley, my friend, I say this with</p>
<p begin="00:31:39.912" end="00:31:44.612" style="s2">respect. Bisi died only a few years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:31:42.912" end="00:31:46.312" style="s2">At your age, people expect you to enjoy</p>
<p begin="00:31:44.612" end="00:31:47.612" style="s2">your grandchildren, not start a new life</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.312" end="00:31:49.512" style="s2">with a young girl. Is this not a</p>
<p begin="00:31:47.612" end="00:31:52.712" style="s2">mistake? Who will carry the burden when</p>
<p begin="00:31:49.512" end="00:31:55.012" style="s2">you are old and she is still young?</p>
<p begin="00:31:52.712" end="00:31:56.612" style="s2">Okonkwo, my friend, I loved Bisi with my</p>
<p begin="00:31:55.012" end="00:31:58.512" style="s2">whole heart, but grief does not mean I</p>
<p begin="00:31:56.612" end="00:32:00.212" style="s2">must stop living. When Bisi died, I</p>
<p begin="00:31:58.512" end="00:32:02.012" style="s2">thought my heart had died with her. Amy</p>
<p begin="00:32:00.212" end="00:32:03.912" style="s2">did not take Bisi&#39;s place. She found a</p>
<p begin="00:32:02.012" end="00:32:05.112" style="s2">different place, one that was empty, and</p>
<p begin="00:32:03.912" end="00:32:07.112" style="s2">she filled it with patience and</p>
<p begin="00:32:05.112" end="00:32:08.312" style="s2">laughter. A man is never too old to be</p>
<p begin="00:32:07.112" end="00:32:09.712" style="s2">loved again.</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.312" end="00:32:11.012" style="s2">And a woman is never too young to choose</p>
<p begin="00:32:09.712" end="00:32:12.412" style="s2">who she loves.</p>
<p begin="00:32:11.012" end="00:32:16.202" style="s2">If tomorrow takes me, I will have lived</p>
<p begin="00:32:12.412" end="00:32:18.222" style="s2">my last years happy, not lonely.</p>
<p begin="00:32:16.202" end="00:32:18.222" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="00:32:35.912" end="00:32:40.112" style="s2">If this is what love feels like, then I</p>
<p begin="00:32:38.312" end="00:32:42.712" style="s2">don&#39;t need anything [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:32:40.112" end="00:32:42.712" style="s2">more.</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.413" end="00:32:49.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy Amy, you were great in there.</p>
<p begin="00:32:47.513" end="00:32:51.013" style="s2">Nobody could say a word after you spoke.</p>
<p begin="00:32:49.613" end="00:32:53.113" style="s2">I am proud of you.</p>
<p begin="00:32:51.013" end="00:32:55.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Toby. Sit well. We are</p>
<p begin="00:32:53.113" end="00:32:55.713" style="s2">leaving soon.</p>
<p begin="00:32:56.013" end="00:32:58.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy,</p>
<p begin="00:32:57.113" end="00:33:00.313" style="s2">Amy,</p>
<p begin="00:32:58.313" end="00:33:02.413" style="s2">it is really you. I saw you in there</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.313" end="00:33:03.713" style="s2">speaking like a queen. Three years ago</p>
<p begin="00:33:02.413" end="00:33:05.513" style="s2">you were selling recharge cards by the</p>
<p begin="00:33:03.713" end="00:33:07.013" style="s2">roadside and I left when your mother</p>
<p begin="00:33:05.513" end="00:33:08.913" style="s2">fell sick because I was afraid of</p>
<p begin="00:33:07.013" end="00:33:10.613" style="s2">poverty. I was a fool and I have thought</p>
<p begin="00:33:08.913" end="00:33:13.213" style="s2">about you every day since.</p>
<p begin="00:33:10.613" end="00:33:15.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daniel, that was years ago. We ended it</p>
<p begin="00:33:13.213" end="00:33:16.113" style="s2">and I have moved on. You should move on,</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.113" end="00:33:17.713" style="s2">too.</p>
<p begin="00:33:16.113" end="00:33:20.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy, people say you married an old man</p>
<p begin="00:33:17.713" end="00:33:21.713" style="s2">for his money. Tell me it is not true. A</p>
<p begin="00:33:20.113" end="00:33:23.313" style="s2">girl your age belongs with a man who can</p>
<p begin="00:33:21.713" end="00:33:24.613" style="s2">run with her and laugh with her, not a</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.313" end="00:33:26.113" style="s2">man who is already near the end of his</p>
<p begin="00:33:24.613" end="00:33:28.113" style="s2">journey.</p>
<p begin="00:33:26.113" end="00:33:29.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daniel, listen carefully. When I had</p>
<p begin="00:33:28.113" end="00:33:31.313" style="s2">nothing you ran and Kingsley held my</p>
<p begin="00:33:29.713" end="00:33:32.913" style="s2">hand. That is the difference between a</p>
<p begin="00:33:31.313" end="00:33:34.713" style="s2">boy and a man and it has nothing to do</p>
<p begin="00:33:32.913" end="00:33:36.613" style="s2">with age. I am no longer interested in</p>
<p begin="00:33:34.713" end="00:33:38.313" style="s2">what we had. I am happily married and I</p>
<p begin="00:33:36.613" end="00:33:39.813" style="s2">will never leave my husband for anybody.</p>
<p begin="00:33:38.313" end="00:33:42.113" style="s2">Please let me go in peace and find</p>
<p begin="00:33:39.813" end="00:33:42.113" style="s2">yours.</p>
<p begin="00:33:45.938" end="00:33:47.958" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:33:52.488" end="00:33:54.508" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:33:59.513" end="00:34:04.313" style="s2">I still cannot understand that marriage.</p>
<p begin="00:34:01.913" end="00:34:06.013" style="s2">The age difference is too much.</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.313" end="00:34:07.313" style="s2">Perhaps Amy loves him.</p>
<p begin="00:34:06.013" end="00:34:10.313" style="s2">Perhaps she loves the life he can</p>
<p begin="00:34:07.313" end="00:34:11.913" style="s2">provide. We cannot know for sure.</p>
<p begin="00:34:10.313" end="00:34:15.413" style="s2">If she married someone her own age,</p>
<p begin="00:34:11.913" end="00:34:15.413" style="s2">would she have this kind of comfort?</p>
<p begin="00:34:16.068" end="00:34:18.088" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:34:21.613" end="00:34:24.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I see the office has become a place</p>
<p begin="00:34:23.113" end="00:34:26.113" style="s2">where people discuss marriages they are</p>
<p begin="00:34:24.613" end="00:34:28.713" style="s2">not part of.</p>
<p begin="00:34:26.113" end="00:34:30.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You should not have to hear that.</p>
<p begin="00:34:28.713" end="00:34:31.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Neither should you.</p>
<p begin="00:34:30.213" end="00:34:34.013" style="s2">They have decided that because I am</p>
<p begin="00:34:31.513" end="00:34:35.313" style="s2">younger my love must be false.</p>
<p begin="00:34:34.013" end="00:34:38.213" style="s2">They have decided that because you are</p>
<p begin="00:34:35.313" end="00:34:39.613" style="s2">older you must be buying my affection.</p>
<p begin="00:34:38.213" end="00:34:41.914" style="s2">Neither of them has asked what happens</p>
<p begin="00:34:39.613" end="00:34:42.814" style="s2">between us when nobody is watching.</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.914" end="00:34:44.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does it make [music] you question your</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.814" end="00:34:45.914" style="s2">decision?</p>
<p begin="00:34:44.014" end="00:34:47.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, but I would be lying if I said it</p>
<p begin="00:34:45.914" end="00:34:48.614" style="s2">never hurts.</p>
<p begin="00:34:47.314" end="00:34:50.014" style="s2">I did not marry you to spend my life</p>
<p begin="00:34:48.614" end="00:34:51.514" style="s2">proving that I am not a gold digger. I</p>
<p begin="00:34:50.014" end="00:34:53.114" style="s2">married you because I love the man you</p>
<p begin="00:34:51.514" end="00:34:54.914" style="s2">are. I knew you had children,</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.114" end="00:34:57.114" style="s2">responsibilities, and a past. I knew all</p>
<p begin="00:34:54.914" end="00:34:59.114" style="s2">of that, and I still chose you.</p>
<p begin="00:34:57.114" end="00:35:01.214" style="s2">I know the age difference exists. I am</p>
<p begin="00:34:59.114" end="00:35:02.314" style="s2">not pretending we are the same age, but</p>
<p begin="00:35:01.214" end="00:35:03.714" style="s2">a difference in age does not</p>
<p begin="00:35:02.314" end="00:35:05.814" style="s2">automatically mean a difference in the</p>
<p begin="00:35:03.714" end="00:35:07.114" style="s2">ability to love. What matters is how we</p>
<p begin="00:35:05.814" end="00:35:08.714" style="s2">treat each other, how we handle</p>
<p begin="00:35:07.114" end="00:35:11.714" style="s2">problems, and whether we respect the</p>
<p begin="00:35:08.714" end="00:35:11.714" style="s2">choices we have made.</p>
<p begin="00:35:12.399" end="00:35:14.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:35:12.714" end="00:35:15.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know you love me.</p>
<p begin="00:35:14.314" end="00:35:16.984" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then remember that when you hear people</p>
<p begin="00:35:15.814" end="00:35:19.014" style="s2">talking.</p>
<p begin="00:35:16.984" end="00:35:20.514" style="s2">[music] I cannot stop every rumor, but I</p>
<p begin="00:35:19.014" end="00:35:23.614" style="s2">can continue to show up for this</p>
<p begin="00:35:20.514" end="00:35:24.914" style="s2">marriage. I need you to do the same.</p>
<p begin="00:35:23.614" end="00:35:25.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will.</p>
<p begin="00:35:24.914" end="00:35:27.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:35:25.914" end="00:35:28.714" style="s2">Now can we finish work?</p>
<p begin="00:35:27.514" end="00:35:30.114" style="s2">I would rather spend the evening with my</p>
<p begin="00:35:28.714" end="00:35:33.114" style="s2">husband than argue with people who are</p>
<p begin="00:35:30.114" end="00:35:33.114" style="s2">not paying our bills.</p>
<p begin="00:35:34.669" end="00:35:36.689" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:35:44.914" end="00:35:48.514" style="s2">Tell me honestly, is marriage treating</p>
<p begin="00:35:46.914" end="00:35:51.214" style="s2">you well, or are you only showing me the</p>
<p begin="00:35:48.514" end="00:35:53.214" style="s2">beautiful parts? It is treating me well,</p>
<p begin="00:35:51.214" end="00:35:54.414" style="s2">but marriage is not a permanent holiday.</p>
<p begin="00:35:53.214" end="00:35:55.914" style="s2">You learn the person you love in new</p>
<p begin="00:35:54.414" end="00:35:57.514" style="s2">ways. You learn their habits, their</p>
<p begin="00:35:55.914" end="00:35:59.014" style="s2">fears, and the things they do not always</p>
<p begin="00:35:57.514" end="00:36:01.614" style="s2">know how to say.</p>
<p begin="00:35:59.014" end="00:36:03.614" style="s2">And Kingsley? He is still the same man,</p>
<p begin="00:36:01.614" end="00:36:05.214" style="s2">quiet, thoughtful, and sometimes so</p>
<p begin="00:36:03.614" end="00:36:07.114" style="s2">determined to solve a problem himself</p>
<p begin="00:36:05.214" end="00:36:09.414" style="s2">that he forgets he has a wife. Have you</p>
<p begin="00:36:07.114" end="00:36:10.714" style="s2">told him that? Of course. I can respect</p>
<p begin="00:36:09.414" end="00:36:12.314" style="s2">my husband and still tell him when I</p>
<p begin="00:36:10.714" end="00:36:15.014" style="s2">think he is wrong. Love should make us</p>
<p begin="00:36:12.314" end="00:36:16.714" style="s2">honest, not silent.</p>
<p begin="00:36:15.014" end="00:36:17.914" style="s2">That is what I want for you.</p>
<p begin="00:36:16.714" end="00:36:19.514" style="s2">Not a marriage that looks perfect from</p>
<p begin="00:36:17.914" end="00:36:21.414" style="s2">the outside, but one where you can speak</p>
<p begin="00:36:19.514" end="00:36:23.414" style="s2">honestly and still feel safe. That is</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.414" end="00:36:24.914" style="s2">what I want to. I want us to grow old</p>
<p begin="00:36:23.414" end="00:36:27.070" style="s2">together without either of us feeling</p>
<p begin="00:36:24.914" end="00:36:29.090" style="s2">that we must pretend to be someone else.</p>
<p begin="00:36:27.070" end="00:36:29.090" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:36:29.714" end="00:36:32.214" style="s2">I have to pick Zara and Toby up from</p>
<p begin="00:36:31.214" end="00:36:34.414" style="s2">school.</p>
<p begin="00:36:32.214" end="00:36:35.814" style="s2">Kingsley is tied up in a meeting.</p>
<p begin="00:36:34.414" end="00:36:37.914" style="s2">Look at you,</p>
<p begin="00:36:35.814" end="00:36:40.014" style="s2">wife and school run driver.</p>
<p begin="00:36:37.914" end="00:36:41.614" style="s2">They are my family. I cannot expect them</p>
<p begin="00:36:40.014" end="00:36:42.716" style="s2">to accept me as part of their lives if I</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.614" end="00:36:45.316" style="s2">only show up when everything is</p>
<p begin="00:36:42.716" end="00:36:45.316" style="s2">convenient.</p>
<p begin="00:36:46.216" end="00:36:50.416" style="s2">You have a good heart, Amy.</p>
<p begin="00:36:48.116" end="00:36:52.916" style="s2">Keep it, but do not let anybody take</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.416" end="00:36:56.216" style="s2">advantage of it.</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.916" end="00:36:56.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will remember that.</p>
<p begin="00:37:06.416" end="00:37:10.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zara, is Amy really your stepmother? She</p>
<p begin="00:37:08.616" end="00:37:11.716" style="s2">looks so young.</p>
<p begin="00:37:10.016" end="00:37:13.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, why?</p>
<p begin="00:37:11.716" end="00:37:14.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; People say she married your father for</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.216" end="00:37:15.616" style="s2">his money.</p>
<p begin="00:37:14.316" end="00:37:17.116" style="s2">What if she has a baby and your father</p>
<p begin="00:37:15.616" end="00:37:19.616" style="s2">starts caring more about her child than</p>
<p begin="00:37:17.116" end="00:37:21.916" style="s2">you and Toby?</p>
<p begin="00:37:19.616" end="00:37:23.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know nothing about my family.</p>
<p begin="00:37:21.916" end="00:37:25.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We are only asking.</p>
<p begin="00:37:23.716" end="00:37:28.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then stop asking questions about things</p>
<p begin="00:37:25.316" end="00:37:28.416" style="s2">that do not concern you.</p>
<p begin="00:37:31.116" end="00:37:34.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hi, Amy.</p>
<p begin="00:37:32.916" end="00:37:35.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zara, sweetheart, is everything all</p>
<p begin="00:37:34.516" end="00:37:38.316" style="s2">right?</p>
<p begin="00:37:35.916" end="00:37:38.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:37:41.116" end="00:37:46.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have barely looked at me.</p>
<p begin="00:37:43.016" end="00:37:47.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Must I look at you every time I see you?</p>
<p begin="00:37:46.316" end="00:37:49.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No,</p>
<p begin="00:37:47.816" end="00:37:50.416" style="s2">but you do not normally speak to me like</p>
<p begin="00:37:49.316" end="00:37:51.916" style="s2">that.</p>
<p begin="00:37:50.416" end="00:37:52.816" style="s2">If something is troubling you, you can</p>
<p begin="00:37:51.916" end="00:37:55.916" style="s2">tell me.</p>
<p begin="00:37:52.816" end="00:37:55.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said I am fine.</p>
<p begin="00:37:58.916" end="00:38:02.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She was fine this morning.</p>
<p begin="00:38:01.216" end="00:38:06.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Something must have happened at school.</p>
<p begin="00:38:02.916" end="00:38:06.016" style="s2">Let us get home first.</p>
<p begin="00:38:13.181" end="00:38:15.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:38:21.041" end="00:38:23.061" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.971" end="00:38:28.246" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:38:26.816" end="00:38:29.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, I do not want to be afraid,</p>
<p begin="00:38:28.246" end="00:38:32.216" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:38:29.516" end="00:38:32.216" style="s2">but I am.</p>
<p begin="00:38:41.816" end="00:38:46.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zara, it is Amy. I will not force the</p>
<p begin="00:38:44.316" end="00:38:47.517" style="s2">door. I will just sit here if will allow</p>
<p begin="00:38:46.517" end="00:38:49.517" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.517" end="00:38:51.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please go away.</p>
<p begin="00:38:49.517" end="00:38:52.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will not go far. I know what you heard</p>
<p begin="00:38:51.217" end="00:38:54.817" style="s2">today [music] and I know what you are</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.917" end="00:38:56.617" style="s2">feeling. When I came into this house, I</p>
<p begin="00:38:54.817" end="00:38:57.617" style="s2">was afraid too.</p>
<p begin="00:38:56.617" end="00:38:59.317" style="s2">I was afraid [music] that people were</p>
<p begin="00:38:57.617" end="00:39:00.517" style="s2">right, that I was too young and did not</p>
<p begin="00:38:59.317" end="00:39:02.017" style="s2">belong.</p>
<p begin="00:39:00.517" end="00:39:03.917" style="s2">I was afraid of standing in a room full</p>
<p begin="00:39:02.017" end="00:39:05.117" style="s2">of your mother&#39;s memories.</p>
<p begin="00:39:03.917" end="00:39:06.317" style="s2">Your mother was here before me and</p>
<p begin="00:39:05.117" end="00:39:07.717" style="s2">nobody can change that. She [music]</p>
<p begin="00:39:06.317" end="00:39:09.117" style="s2">loved your father. She loved you and</p>
<p begin="00:39:07.717" end="00:39:10.717" style="s2">Toby and she built this home. I will</p>
<p begin="00:39:09.117" end="00:39:12.417" style="s2">never take her place. I am not trying</p>
<p begin="00:39:10.717" end="00:39:14.417" style="s2">to. [music] I only want a small place</p>
<p begin="00:39:12.417" end="00:39:16.217" style="s2">beside her, a place where I can love</p>
<p begin="00:39:14.417" end="00:39:17.917" style="s2">you, cook for you and support [music]</p>
<p begin="00:39:16.217" end="00:39:19.317" style="s2">you when you need someone.</p>
<p begin="00:39:17.917" end="00:39:22.017" style="s2">Your father&#39;s heart is not a cup that</p>
<p begin="00:39:19.317" end="00:39:23.917" style="s2">runs empty. Love is not like money. When</p>
<p begin="00:39:22.017" end="00:39:26.317" style="s2">you share it, it does not reduce. It</p>
<p begin="00:39:23.917" end="00:39:28.417" style="s2">grows. What if he forgets [music] us? He</p>
<p begin="00:39:26.317" end="00:39:30.717" style="s2">will never forget you. You are the proof</p>
<p begin="00:39:28.417" end="00:39:31.717" style="s2">of the love he had with your mother.</p>
<p begin="00:39:30.717" end="00:39:33.817" style="s2">And Zara, there [music] is something I</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.717" end="00:39:36.217" style="s2">want you to hear first before anyone</p>
<p begin="00:39:33.817" end="00:39:37.717" style="s2">else because you matter to me.</p>
<p begin="00:39:36.217" end="00:39:38.917" style="s2">I am going to have a baby. I [music]</p>
<p begin="00:39:37.717" end="00:39:40.417" style="s2">wanted to tell your father on his</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.917" end="00:39:41.717" style="s2">birthday, but I could not keep it from</p>
<p begin="00:39:40.417" end="00:39:43.217" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:39:41.717" end="00:39:45.817" style="s2">This baby will not take anything from</p>
<p begin="00:39:43.217" end="00:39:48.867" style="s2">you. She will have two big siblings who</p>
<p begin="00:39:45.817" end="00:39:48.867" style="s2">will teach her everything. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:39:49.517" end="00:39:54.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are going to have a baby?</p>
<p begin="00:39:51.917" end="00:39:56.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, my dear.</p>
<p begin="00:39:54.617" end="00:39:57.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought</p>
<p begin="00:39:56.117" end="00:39:58.917" style="s2">I thought you had been hiding something</p>
<p begin="00:39:57.327" end="00:39:59.617" style="s2">[music] because you wanted to replace</p>
<p begin="00:39:58.917" end="00:40:01.817" style="s2">us.</p>
<p begin="00:39:59.617" end="00:40:03.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was hiding my joy, Zara.</p>
<p begin="00:40:01.817" end="00:40:05.117" style="s2">And I was afraid of how you would feel.</p>
<p begin="00:40:03.717" end="00:40:05.817" style="s2">I am [music] so sorry I did not talk to</p>
<p begin="00:40:05.117" end="00:40:08.017" style="s2">you sooner.</p>
<p begin="00:40:05.817" end="00:40:10.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am sorry I locked the door. I am sorry</p>
<p begin="00:40:08.017" end="00:40:12.117" style="s2">I spoke to you that way.</p>
<p begin="00:40:10.617" end="00:40:13.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There is nothing to forgive. You were</p>
<p begin="00:40:12.117" end="00:40:16.217" style="s2">protecting [music] your mother. That is</p>
<p begin="00:40:13.817" end="00:40:16.217" style="s2">love.</p>
<p begin="00:40:17.117" end="00:40:20.317" style="s2">May I keep Mummy&#39;s [music] shawl?</p>
<p begin="00:40:18.817" end="00:40:23.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everything in this room belongs to you</p>
<p begin="00:40:20.317" end="00:40:23.717" style="s2">and Toby, always.</p>
<p begin="00:40:25.493" end="00:40:27.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:40:40.217" end="00:40:43.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy, you have been choosing the colors</p>
<p begin="00:40:41.317" end="00:40:44.917" style="s2">for nearly an hour. Zara will say you</p>
<p begin="00:40:43.017" end="00:40:46.717" style="s2">are spoiling her.</p>
<p begin="00:40:44.917" end="00:40:48.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me spoil her a little. She deserves</p>
<p begin="00:40:46.717" end="00:40:50.218" style="s2">it. She works so hard and she has been</p>
<p begin="00:40:48.717" end="00:40:53.018" style="s2">so quiet these days. I just want her to</p>
<p begin="00:40:50.218" end="00:40:53.018" style="s2">know she is loved.</p>
<p begin="00:40:53.918" end="00:40:57.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are pale. Come, let us sit.</p>
<p begin="00:40:56.818" end="00:40:59.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy,</p>
<p begin="00:40:57.618" end="00:41:02.718" style="s2">you cannot ignore me again. Tell your</p>
<p begin="00:40:59.618" end="00:41:02.718" style="s2">husband what you promised me.</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.318" end="00:41:15.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daniel, what are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:41:13.918" end="00:41:16.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You swore that once you married this</p>
<p begin="00:41:15.318" end="00:41:18.318" style="s2">rich man, you would take his money and</p>
<p begin="00:41:16.718" end="00:41:19.918" style="s2">give me my share. I helped you when you</p>
<p begin="00:41:18.318" end="00:41:21.318" style="s2">had nothing. Now you walk past me like a</p>
<p begin="00:41:19.918" end="00:41:22.818" style="s2">stranger.</p>
<p begin="00:41:21.318" end="00:41:24.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daniel, I never said that. You know it</p>
<p begin="00:41:22.818" end="00:41:27.018" style="s2">is not true.</p>
<p begin="00:41:24.918" end="00:41:28.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay behind me.</p>
<p begin="00:41:27.018" end="00:41:31.118" style="s2">Young man, lower your voice.</p>
<p begin="00:41:28.918" end="00:41:33.318" style="s2">You are standing in front of my wife.</p>
<p begin="00:41:31.118" end="00:41:35.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your wife is a liar. She does not love</p>
<p begin="00:41:33.318" end="00:41:37.118" style="s2">you. She loves your money.</p>
<p begin="00:41:35.418" end="00:41:39.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My wife has never lied to me [music] and</p>
<p begin="00:41:37.118" end="00:41:41.018" style="s2">she has never promised you anything. I</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.118" end="00:41:42.818" style="s2">know her heart. If you have a quarrel</p>
<p begin="00:41:41.018" end="00:41:44.518" style="s2">with her, you will come through me. But</p>
<p begin="00:41:42.818" end="00:41:47.918" style="s2">I will not allow any man to harass her</p>
<p begin="00:41:44.518" end="00:41:47.918" style="s2">in public. Is that clear?</p>
<p begin="00:41:51.318" end="00:41:55.418" style="s2">Please, officer, escort this young man</p>
<p begin="00:41:53.018" end="00:41:57.218" style="s2">out of the mall gently. He is upset, not</p>
<p begin="00:41:55.418" end="00:41:58.618" style="s2">dangerous.</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.218" end="00:42:01.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You will see.</p>
<p begin="00:41:58.618" end="00:42:01.718" style="s2">She does not love you.</p>
<p begin="00:42:02.018" end="00:42:05.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is between her and me.</p>
<p begin="00:42:12.318" end="00:42:15.918" style="s2">Come, my dear. Let us go home.</p>
<p begin="00:42:17.499" end="00:42:20.174" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:42:18.154" end="00:42:20.174" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:42:20.918" end="00:42:24.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy, I want to speak and I want you to</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.618" end="00:42:25.618" style="s2">hear me without fear. I am not angry</p>
<p begin="00:42:24.318" end="00:42:26.918" style="s2">with you,</p>
<p begin="00:42:25.618" end="00:42:28.518" style="s2">but I am hurt.</p>
<p begin="00:42:26.918" end="00:42:30.118" style="s2">A stranger stood in a public place and</p>
<p begin="00:42:28.518" end="00:42:31.618" style="s2">said things about my wife and about our</p>
<p begin="00:42:30.118" end="00:42:32.918" style="s2">marriage and I did not even know who he</p>
<p begin="00:42:31.618" end="00:42:34.518" style="s2">was.</p>
<p begin="00:42:32.918" end="00:42:36.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kingsley, I should have told you. His</p>
<p begin="00:42:34.518" end="00:42:38.318" style="s2">name is Daniel. He was my boyfriend</p>
<p begin="00:42:36.318" end="00:42:40.118" style="s2">years ago. He left me when my mother</p>
<p begin="00:42:38.318" end="00:42:41.418" style="s2">fell sick and I was poor.</p>
<p begin="00:42:40.118" end="00:42:43.318" style="s2">At the gala, he came to me in the car</p>
<p begin="00:42:41.418" end="00:42:44.818" style="s2">park and said he regretted leaving. I</p>
<p begin="00:42:43.318" end="00:42:46.118" style="s2">told him clearly that it was finished,</p>
<p begin="00:42:44.818" end="00:42:48.218" style="s2">that I am happily married and I would</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.118" end="00:42:49.718" style="s2">never leave my husband for anybody.</p>
<p begin="00:42:48.218" end="00:42:51.920" style="s2">I did not tell you because I thought the</p>
<p begin="00:42:49.718" end="00:42:52.920" style="s2">matter was closed and I did not want to</p>
<p begin="00:42:51.920" end="00:42:54.920" style="s2">trouble you on the night of your</p>
<p begin="00:42:52.920" end="00:42:58.120" style="s2">anniversary. I was wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:42:54.920" end="00:42:59.620" style="s2">You deserve to hear it from me.</p>
<p begin="00:42:58.120" end="00:43:01.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you for telling me everything. Now</p>
<p begin="00:42:59.620" end="00:43:02.620" style="s2">let me be honest with you too. As we</p>
<p begin="00:43:01.120" end="00:43:04.520" style="s2">walked to the car today, a thought</p>
<p begin="00:43:02.620" end="00:43:06.220" style="s2">entered my heart. It asked me, does she</p>
<p begin="00:43:04.520" end="00:43:07.720" style="s2">truly love you or is what people say</p>
<p begin="00:43:06.220" end="00:43:09.520" style="s2">true, that a young woman cannot love a</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.720" end="00:43:10.920" style="s2">man of 50, that when the new wears off</p>
<p begin="00:43:09.520" end="00:43:14.520" style="s2">she will look back? I did not believe</p>
<p begin="00:43:10.920" end="00:43:14.520" style="s2">it, Amy, but for a moment I listened.</p>
<p begin="00:43:15.920" end="00:43:19.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kingsley, I am glad you told me and I am</p>
<p begin="00:43:17.820" end="00:43:20.420" style="s2">not angry.</p>
<p begin="00:43:19.220" end="00:43:22.020" style="s2">Doubt is not a crime when you bring it</p>
<p begin="00:43:20.420" end="00:43:23.620" style="s2">to the person you love.</p>
<p begin="00:43:22.020" end="00:43:25.020" style="s2">Listen to me. If I wanted money, I would</p>
<p begin="00:43:23.620" end="00:43:26.420" style="s2">not have chosen the hardest road, the</p>
<p begin="00:43:25.020" end="00:43:28.620" style="s2">one that people laughed at, the one with</p>
<p begin="00:43:26.420" end="00:43:30.020" style="s2">society&#39;s judgment on it. I chose you</p>
<p begin="00:43:28.620" end="00:43:31.920" style="s2">because on the day I had nothing you</p>
<p begin="00:43:30.020" end="00:43:33.620" style="s2">looked at me and saw a person.</p>
<p begin="00:43:31.920" end="00:43:35.920" style="s2">A boy like Daniel sees what he wants.</p>
<p begin="00:43:33.620" end="00:43:37.920" style="s2">You see who I am. I love you, Kingsley,</p>
<p begin="00:43:35.920" end="00:43:39.420" style="s2">not your money, not your name, you.</p>
<p begin="00:43:37.920" end="00:43:40.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When that young man shouted I looked at</p>
<p begin="00:43:39.420" end="00:43:42.820" style="s2">your face, Amy.</p>
<p begin="00:43:40.920" end="00:43:45.320" style="s2">A guilty person looks away. You looked</p>
<p begin="00:43:42.820" end="00:43:47.120" style="s2">straight at me, shocked but honest.</p>
<p begin="00:43:45.320" end="00:43:48.320" style="s2">I decided then and I decide again now,</p>
<p begin="00:43:47.120" end="00:43:50.120" style="s2">no.</p>
<p begin="00:43:48.320" end="00:43:53.520" style="s2">My wife loves me and I will stand with</p>
<p begin="00:43:50.120" end="00:43:55.820" style="s2">you in public and in private always.</p>
<p begin="00:43:53.520" end="00:43:57.520" style="s2">That is what a husband owes his wife.</p>
<p begin="00:43:55.820" end="00:43:58.920" style="s2">I will not let a stranger plant a seed</p>
<p begin="00:43:57.520" end="00:43:59.720" style="s2">of doubt in a field that God has</p>
<p begin="00:43:58.920" end="00:44:02.320" style="s2">watered.</p>
<p begin="00:43:59.720" end="00:44:04.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And from today, no secrets between us,</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.320" end="00:44:06.720" style="s2">even the small ones.</p>
<p begin="00:44:04.020" end="00:44:06.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No secrets.</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.820" end="00:44:12.020" style="s2">But something does worry me.</p>
<p begin="00:44:10.720" end="00:44:13.720" style="s2">That boy knew we would be at that mall</p>
<p begin="00:44:12.020" end="00:44:15.220" style="s2">today. He spoke words that were not his</p>
<p begin="00:44:13.720" end="00:44:16.220" style="s2">own. Somebody put those lies in his</p>
<p begin="00:44:15.220" end="00:44:18.820" style="s2">mouth.</p>
<p begin="00:44:16.220" end="00:44:21.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At the gala I saw a woman. I did not see</p>
<p begin="00:44:18.820" end="00:44:21.420" style="s2">her face.</p>
<p begin="00:44:24.120" end="00:44:27.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, I heard everything.</p>
<p begin="00:44:26.520" end="00:44:29.220" style="s2">Mommy Amy, I want you to know I have</p>
<p begin="00:44:27.920" end="00:44:30.720" style="s2">been on your side since the first day</p>
<p begin="00:44:29.220" end="00:44:32.920" style="s2">you walked into this house. You have</p>
<p begin="00:44:30.720" end="00:44:34.320" style="s2">never given us any reason to doubt you.</p>
<p begin="00:44:32.920" end="00:44:35.620" style="s2">Whoever is doing this, we will find</p>
<p begin="00:44:34.320" end="00:44:37.720" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="00:44:35.620" end="00:44:40.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Toby.</p>
<p begin="00:44:37.720" end="00:44:42.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your father agrees.</p>
<p begin="00:44:40.520" end="00:44:45.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No words</p>
<p begin="00:44:42.720" end="00:44:45.820" style="s2">just a</p>
<p begin="00:44:51.520" end="00:44:54.420" style="s2">with me.</p>
<p begin="00:44:54.920" end="00:44:58.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oga, there is a young man at the gate.</p>
<p begin="00:44:56.921" end="00:45:01.621" style="s2">He says his name is Daniel. He says he</p>
<p begin="00:44:58.721" end="00:45:01.621" style="s2">came to apologize.</p>
<p begin="00:45:05.521" end="00:45:08.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let him in.</p>
<p begin="00:45:11.221" end="00:45:15.921" style="s2">Good morning, sir. Madam Amy.</p>
<p begin="00:45:13.721" end="00:45:17.721" style="s2">Please, I have not slept since Saturday.</p>
<p begin="00:45:15.921" end="00:45:20.521" style="s2">I did not come to cause trouble. I came</p>
<p begin="00:45:17.721" end="00:45:22.121" style="s2">to tell the truth.</p>
<p begin="00:45:20.521" end="00:45:24.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Speak.</p>
<p begin="00:45:22.121" end="00:45:26.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What I said at the mall was a lie.</p>
<p begin="00:45:24.421" end="00:45:27.521" style="s2">Amy never promised me anything.</p>
<p begin="00:45:26.521" end="00:45:29.721" style="s2">Never.</p>
<p begin="00:45:27.521" end="00:45:31.721" style="s2">A woman paid me to say those words. She</p>
<p begin="00:45:29.721" end="00:45:33.821" style="s2">gave me 500,000 Naira.</p>
<p begin="00:45:31.721" end="00:45:35.521" style="s2">I never saw her face. She wore a scarf</p>
<p begin="00:45:33.821" end="00:45:36.521" style="s2">and dark glasses, but I remember her red</p>
<p begin="00:45:35.521" end="00:45:37.721" style="s2">nails and a gold bracelet with a</p>
<p begin="00:45:36.521" end="00:45:38.821" style="s2">butterfly on it.</p>
<p begin="00:45:37.721" end="00:45:40.521" style="s2">She told me exactly where you would be</p>
<p begin="00:45:38.821" end="00:45:42.121" style="s2">on Saturday and what to say.</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.521" end="00:45:43.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The butterfly bracelet.</p>
<p begin="00:45:42.121" end="00:45:45.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought I loved Amy</p>
<p begin="00:45:43.721" end="00:45:46.821" style="s2">and I was bitter.</p>
<p begin="00:45:45.221" end="00:45:48.521" style="s2">When Mr. Kingsley stood in front of her</p>
<p begin="00:45:46.821" end="00:45:49.721" style="s2">and defended her without even shouting</p>
<p begin="00:45:48.521" end="00:45:51.021" style="s2">at me,</p>
<p begin="00:45:49.721" end="00:45:53.021" style="s2">I understood the difference between a</p>
<p begin="00:45:51.021" end="00:45:55.421" style="s2">man who wants a woman and a man who</p>
<p begin="00:45:53.021" end="00:45:55.421" style="s2">loves her.</p>
<p begin="00:45:55.521" end="00:45:58.621" style="s2">I have not spent a kobo.</p>
<p begin="00:45:57.321" end="00:46:00.321" style="s2">Please forgive me.</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.621" end="00:46:01.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daniel, what you did was wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:46:00.321" end="00:46:02.421" style="s2">You tried to break a marriage with a</p>
<p begin="00:46:01.421" end="00:46:04.221" style="s2">lie.</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.421" end="00:46:06.721" style="s2">But a man who comes back to confess even</p>
<p begin="00:46:04.221" end="00:46:07.921" style="s2">late has begun to repair himself.</p>
<p begin="00:46:06.721" end="00:46:09.221" style="s2">Go in peace</p>
<p begin="00:46:07.921" end="00:46:10.821" style="s2">and find work that lets you hold your</p>
<p begin="00:46:09.221" end="00:46:13.221" style="s2">head high.</p>
<p begin="00:46:10.821" end="00:46:15.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daniel, I forgave you long ago.</p>
<p begin="00:46:13.221" end="00:46:15.921" style="s2">Go home and heal.</p>
<p begin="00:46:17.321" end="00:46:21.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A butterfly bracelet.</p>
<p begin="00:46:19.421" end="00:46:22.721" style="s2">I know that bracelet. I bought it for</p>
<p begin="00:46:21.321" end="00:46:24.021" style="s2">Glory when we were both fooling</p>
<p begin="00:46:22.721" end="00:46:25.121" style="s2">ourselves that she should marry my</p>
<p begin="00:46:24.021" end="00:46:28.121" style="s2">brother.</p>
<p begin="00:46:25.121" end="00:46:31.821" style="s2">Kingsley, Amy, I know where to find her.</p>
<p begin="00:46:28.121" end="00:46:31.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pauline, do not do anything unlawful.</p>
<p begin="00:46:32.521" end="00:46:35.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will not.</p>
<p begin="00:46:33.721" end="00:46:38.421" style="s2">But Glory and I walked the same crooked</p>
<p begin="00:46:35.521" end="00:46:40.021" style="s2">road. I was blind and Amy forgave me. It</p>
<p begin="00:46:38.421" end="00:46:41.921" style="s2">is my duty to stop her before she</p>
<p begin="00:46:40.021" end="00:46:43.421" style="s2">destroys herself. Leave her to me. I am</p>
<p begin="00:46:41.921" end="00:46:45.021" style="s2">coming with you.</p>
<p begin="00:46:43.421" end="00:46:48.021" style="s2">She did this to my marriage. I have the</p>
<p begin="00:46:45.021" end="00:46:49.321" style="s2">right to look her in the face.</p>
<p begin="00:46:48.021" end="00:46:52.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go.</p>
<p begin="00:46:49.321" end="00:46:52.321" style="s2">But go with calm hearts.</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.221" end="00:47:02.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pauline and the small girl herself, what</p>
<p begin="00:46:59.323" end="00:47:02.122" style="s2">are you doing at my door?</p>
<p begin="00:47:02.323" end="00:47:06.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We came to talk, Glory.</p>
<p begin="00:47:04.323" end="00:47:06.922" style="s2">May we come in?</p>
<p begin="00:47:07.023" end="00:47:10.023" style="s2">On Saturday, a young man shouted lies at</p>
<p begin="00:47:08.723" end="00:47:12.523" style="s2">my brother and his wife in front of a</p>
<p begin="00:47:10.023" end="00:47:14.922" style="s2">whole mall. He said a woman paid him red</p>
<p begin="00:47:12.523" end="00:47:16.223" style="s2">nails, a gold butterfly bracelet.</p>
<p begin="00:47:14.922" end="00:47:18.023" style="s2">Only three kinds of people knew where my</p>
<p begin="00:47:16.223" end="00:47:19.723" style="s2">brother shops on Saturdays, his family,</p>
<p begin="00:47:18.023" end="00:47:21.323" style="s2">his driver, and the staff who used to</p>
<p begin="00:47:19.723" end="00:47:21.723" style="s2">arrange his schedule. You were one of</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.323" end="00:47:23.723" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.723" end="00:47:24.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do not know what you are talking</p>
<p begin="00:47:23.723" end="00:47:26.922" style="s2">about.</p>
<p begin="00:47:24.723" end="00:47:29.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then take off the bracelet.</p>
<p begin="00:47:26.922" end="00:47:32.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This? Many women have bracelets like</p>
<p begin="00:47:29.323" end="00:47:34.023" style="s2">this, not the one I gave you, Glory.</p>
<p begin="00:47:32.422" end="00:47:37.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know the clasp</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.023" end="00:47:39.023" style="s2">because I chose it myself.</p>
<p begin="00:47:37.223" end="00:47:40.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what if it was me? You planned with</p>
<p begin="00:47:39.023" end="00:47:42.323" style="s2">me before, Pauline. You hated that girl</p>
<p begin="00:47:40.622" end="00:47:44.023" style="s2">more than I did. Now you run to her side</p>
<p begin="00:47:42.323" end="00:47:45.523" style="s2">like a servant. What did she give you?</p>
<p begin="00:47:44.023" end="00:47:46.323" style="s2">You were her enemy, and now she has made</p>
<p begin="00:47:45.523" end="00:47:48.023" style="s2">you her slave.</p>
<p begin="00:47:46.323" end="00:47:50.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She gave me mercy. When I deserved</p>
<p begin="00:47:48.023" end="00:47:52.023" style="s2">punishment, she gave me a second chance.</p>
<p begin="00:47:50.122" end="00:47:54.523" style="s2">That is not slavery. That is what a</p>
<p begin="00:47:52.023" end="00:47:56.723" style="s2">changed heart looks like. And you, small</p>
<p begin="00:47:54.523" end="00:47:58.223" style="s2">girl, you think you have won? You think</p>
<p begin="00:47:56.723" end="00:48:00.023" style="s2">a man who is 50 will love you when the</p>
<p begin="00:47:58.223" end="00:48:03.622" style="s2">newness fades? You are nothing but a</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.023" end="00:48:03.622" style="s2">child who caught an old man&#39;s attention.</p>
<p begin="00:48:04.723" end="00:48:09.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They say I am too small,</p>
<p begin="00:48:06.723" end="00:48:11.223" style="s2">but look at you. You are older than me,</p>
<p begin="00:48:09.223" end="00:48:13.223" style="s2">and you still behave like a child. You</p>
<p begin="00:48:11.223" end="00:48:15.823" style="s2">hired a boy to tell lies about me in a</p>
<p begin="00:48:13.223" end="00:48:17.523" style="s2">public place with no shame. Maybe you</p>
<p begin="00:48:15.823" end="00:48:19.223" style="s2">need someone to teach you.</p>
<p begin="00:48:17.523" end="00:48:20.723" style="s2">Being old does not mean you have brains.</p>
<p begin="00:48:19.223" end="00:48:21.922" style="s2">Age gives wisdom only to those who learn</p>
<p begin="00:48:20.723" end="00:48:24.523" style="s2">from their mistakes. You never learned</p>
<p begin="00:48:21.922" end="00:48:24.523" style="s2">from yours.</p>
<p begin="00:48:25.122" end="00:48:28.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Glory, listen to me.</p>
<p begin="00:48:26.723" end="00:48:30.922" style="s2">You have lost your job, your name, and</p>
<p begin="00:48:28.823" end="00:48:32.723" style="s2">your friends, and I know how that feels.</p>
<p begin="00:48:30.922" end="00:48:34.723" style="s2">Nobody is going to break you further,</p>
<p begin="00:48:32.723" end="00:48:36.122" style="s2">but this stops today. If you ever come</p>
<p begin="00:48:34.723" end="00:48:38.223" style="s2">near this family again, I will not be</p>
<p begin="00:48:36.122" end="00:48:40.122" style="s2">gentle. I will go to the police, and I</p>
<p begin="00:48:38.223" end="00:48:41.422" style="s2">will tell them everything.</p>
<p begin="00:48:40.122" end="00:48:43.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then do it.</p>
<p begin="00:48:41.422" end="00:48:45.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have nothing to lose.</p>
<p begin="00:48:43.323" end="00:48:46.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have more than you think.</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.122" end="00:48:49.122" style="s2">My boutique opens at 8 on Monday. There</p>
<p begin="00:48:46.922" end="00:48:50.723" style="s2">is a job for you if you want one. Honest</p>
<p begin="00:48:49.122" end="00:48:52.523" style="s2">work, honest pay. Nobody will remind you</p>
<p begin="00:48:50.723" end="00:48:55.323" style="s2">of this, but you must stay away from Amy</p>
<p begin="00:48:52.523" end="00:48:57.223" style="s2">and Kingsley, and you must change.</p>
<p begin="00:48:55.323" end="00:48:59.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do not want your pity.</p>
<p begin="00:48:57.223" end="00:49:02.024" style="s2">It is not pity. It is what someone once</p>
<p begin="00:48:59.524" end="00:49:02.024" style="s2">did for me.</p>
<p begin="00:49:06.224" end="00:49:08.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:49:10.324" end="00:49:14.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay with me.</p>
<p begin="00:49:17.324" end="00:49:22.824" style="s2">I don&#39;t need a thousand words.</p>
<p begin="00:49:20.924" end="00:49:24.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kingsley, happy birthday. I heard about</p>
<p begin="00:49:22.824" end="00:49:25.824" style="s2">what happened at the mall. I was ready</p>
<p begin="00:49:24.124" end="00:49:27.424" style="s2">to believe the worst, but Pauline tells</p>
<p begin="00:49:25.824" end="00:49:29.124" style="s2">me everything was a lie planned by</p>
<p begin="00:49:27.424" end="00:49:30.724" style="s2">someone who wanted to hurt your family.</p>
<p begin="00:49:29.124" end="00:49:33.024" style="s2">I judged your wife by her age and not by</p>
<p begin="00:49:30.724" end="00:49:35.124" style="s2">her heart. Amy, I am sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:49:33.024" end="00:49:36.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, ma. It takes courage to say</p>
<p begin="00:49:35.124" end="00:49:38.324" style="s2">that.</p>
<p begin="00:49:36.124" end="00:49:39.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kingsley, my friend, at the gala I asked</p>
<p begin="00:49:38.324" end="00:49:41.724" style="s2">who will carry the burden when you are</p>
<p begin="00:49:39.624" end="00:49:43.924" style="s2">old. Today I see the burden was never a</p>
<p begin="00:49:41.724" end="00:49:46.424" style="s2">burden. A man who finds love again at</p>
<p begin="00:49:43.924" end="00:49:48.024" style="s2">any age is a blessed man. To Amy and</p>
<p begin="00:49:46.424" end="00:49:49.724" style="s2">Kingsley.</p>
<p begin="00:49:48.024" end="00:49:51.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kingsley, there is something I have been</p>
<p begin="00:49:49.724" end="00:49:52.724" style="s2">keeping for your birthday. I am</p>
<p begin="00:49:51.724" end="00:49:53.924" style="s2">pregnant.</p>
<p begin="00:49:52.724" end="00:49:55.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy,</p>
<p begin="00:49:53.924" end="00:49:57.524" style="s2">I was afraid to ask for more than I</p>
<p begin="00:49:55.124" end="00:49:59.024" style="s2">already have. I am 51.</p>
<p begin="00:49:57.524" end="00:50:00.524" style="s2">I wondered whether I am too old to be a</p>
<p begin="00:49:59.024" end="00:50:02.124" style="s2">father again.</p>
<p begin="00:50:00.524" end="00:50:04.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, you are not too old. You are the</p>
<p begin="00:50:02.124" end="00:50:06.824" style="s2">best father I know, and this baby will</p>
<p begin="00:50:04.024" end="00:50:06.824" style="s2">be lucky to have you.</p>
<p begin="00:50:06.924" end="00:50:09.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am not too old to love another child.</p>
<p begin="00:50:08.924" end="00:50:11.779" style="s2">Thank you all of you.</p>
<p begin="00:50:09.759" end="00:50:11.779" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:50:26.789" end="00:50:28.809" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:50:30.324" end="00:50:34.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay with me.</p>
<p begin="00:50:36.614" end="00:50:40.824" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:50:37.424" end="00:50:44.224" style="s2">I don&#39;t need a thousand [singing] words.</p>
<p begin="00:50:40.824" end="00:50:46.824" style="s2">When you look at me like that,</p>
<p begin="00:50:44.224" end="00:50:47.924" style="s2">there is something [music] in your eyes,</p>
<p begin="00:50:46.824" end="00:50:51.024" style="s2">something [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:50:47.924" end="00:50:54.524" style="s2">I don&#39;t want to lose.</p>
<p begin="00:50:51.024" end="00:50:57.724" style="s2">When [music] your hand is holding mine,</p>
<p begin="00:50:54.524" end="00:50:58.885" style="s2">everything feels quiet.</p>
<p begin="00:50:57.724" end="00:51:00.424" style="s2">And for [music] a little while,</p>
<p begin="00:50:58.885" end="00:51:04.825" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:51:00.424" end="00:51:08.325" style="s2">the whole world disappears. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:51:04.825" end="00:51:11.625" style="s2">Maybe love is not so loud.</p>
<p begin="00:51:08.325" end="00:51:14.925" style="s2">Maybe love [music] is just this.</p>
<p begin="00:51:11.625" end="00:51:18.425" style="s2">Sitting here beside you, feeling [music]</p>
<p begin="00:51:14.925" end="00:51:21.325" style="s2">safe [singing] in your arms. Stay with</p>
<p begin="00:51:18.425" end="00:51:23.025" style="s2">me tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:51:21.325" end="00:51:24.325" style="s2">Don&#39;t say breathe [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:51:23.025" end="00:51:25.125" style="s2">you in</p>
<p begin="00:51:24.325" end="00:51:28.025" style="s2">slowly. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:51:25.125" end="00:51:29.125" style="s2">If this is what love feels like, then I</p>
<p begin="00:51:28.025" end="00:51:31.125" style="s2">don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:51:29.125" end="00:51:32.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chief, congratulations. Your wife has</p>
<p begin="00:51:31.125" end="00:51:34.725" style="s2">delivered a healthy baby girl. Mother</p>
<p begin="00:51:32.825" end="00:51:36.875" style="s2">and child are doing well.</p>
<p begin="00:51:34.725" end="00:51:39.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t need anything [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:51:36.875" end="00:51:39.325" style="s2">[music] more.</p>
<p begin="00:51:39.925" end="00:51:44.225" style="s2">I have seen the morning come.</p>
<p begin="00:51:43.225" end="00:51:46.125" style="s2">I have watched the</p>
<p begin="00:51:44.225" end="00:51:48.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy, she is perfect. Thank you for</p>
<p begin="00:51:46.125" end="00:51:49.625" style="s2">everything, for loving me, for loving my</p>
<p begin="00:51:48.025" end="00:51:50.925" style="s2">children, for never giving up when the</p>
<p begin="00:51:49.625" end="00:51:52.325" style="s2">world was against us.</p>
<p begin="00:51:50.925" end="00:51:54.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kingsley, thank you for being brave</p>
<p begin="00:51:52.325" end="00:51:55.870" style="s2">enough to love again. Many people close</p>
<p begin="00:51:54.225" end="00:51:58.425" style="s2">their hearts after pain. You opened</p>
<p begin="00:51:55.870" end="00:51:58.425" style="s2">[music] yours.</p>
<p begin="00:51:59.525" end="00:52:04.625" style="s2">Daddy, Amy, I have a name for her. When</p>
<p begin="00:52:02.125" end="00:52:06.325" style="s2">I was angry, our family felt broken.</p>
<p begin="00:52:04.625" end="00:52:08.825" style="s2">Now, when I look at all of us, I see</p>
<p begin="00:52:06.325" end="00:52:11.125" style="s2">peace, a big family of different ages,</p>
<p begin="00:52:08.825" end="00:52:14.525" style="s2">different stories loving each other. I</p>
<p begin="00:52:11.125" end="00:52:14.525" style="s2">think she should be called Harmony.</p>
<p begin="00:52:16.025" end="00:52:19.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Harmony, it is perfect.</p>
<p begin="00:52:17.625" end="00:52:21.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Harmony BC Kingsley</p>
<p begin="00:52:19.725" end="00:52:23.825" style="s2">so that her big sister&#39;s mother will</p>
<p begin="00:52:21.125" end="00:52:26.125" style="s2">always be part of her name too.</p>
<p begin="00:52:23.825" end="00:52:30.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t say [singing] a word. Just [music]</p>
<p begin="00:52:26.125" end="00:52:34.225" style="s2">hold me. Let the world wait outside. I</p>
<p begin="00:52:30.425" end="00:52:36.825" style="s2">just want [music] you close to me. Stay</p>
<p begin="00:52:34.225" end="00:52:39.025" style="s2">with me [singing] tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:52:36.825" end="00:52:41.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They said it would not last. They said I</p>
<p begin="00:52:39.025" end="00:52:43.425" style="s2">was too young and he was too old.</p>
<p begin="00:52:41.325" end="00:52:45.725" style="s2">They said love has an age, [music] but</p>
<p begin="00:52:43.425" end="00:52:47.725" style="s2">love does not check a birth certificate.</p>
<p begin="00:52:45.725" end="00:52:50.965" style="s2">It only asks one question, will you</p>
<p begin="00:52:47.725" end="00:52:50.965" style="s2">stay? And we stayed. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:52:57.225" end="00:53:00.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Never let anyone tell you that your</p>
<p begin="00:52:58.625" end="00:53:02.425" style="s2">heart has expired.</p>
<p begin="00:53:00.525" end="00:53:04.825" style="s2">As long as you are breathing, there is</p>
<p begin="00:53:02.425" end="00:53:04.825" style="s2">room [music] for</p>
<p begin="00:53:09.886" end="00:53:11.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:53:19.711" end="00:53:21.731" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:53:27.571" end="00:53:29.591" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:53:32.811" end="00:53:34.831" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:53:41.127" end="00:53:44.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good afternoon, ma.</p>
<p begin="00:53:42.627" end="00:53:45.627" style="s2">The Kano supplier has accepted our</p>
<p begin="00:53:44.327" end="00:53:47.427" style="s2">terms.</p>
<p begin="00:53:45.627" end="00:53:49.527" style="s2">Wonderful. Please send them the signed</p>
<p begin="00:53:47.427" end="00:53:51.227" style="s2">copy before closing. Yes, ma. And</p>
<p begin="00:53:49.527" end="00:53:54.727" style="s2">congratulations. The whole team says</p>
<p begin="00:53:51.227" end="00:53:54.727" style="s2">this is our biggest contract yet.</p>
<p begin="00:53:56.127" end="00:54:01.027" style="s2">Tell them the credit belongs to</p>
<p begin="00:53:57.327" end="00:54:01.027" style="s2">everyone. I only hold the pen.</p>
<p begin="00:54:08.837" end="00:54:10.857" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:54:16.927" end="00:54:21.827" style="s2">In the end, after all the rumors,</p>
<p begin="00:54:20.027" end="00:54:24.727" style="s2">jealousy, and society&#39;s [music]</p>
<p begin="00:54:21.827" end="00:54:27.127" style="s2">judgment, love stood firm.</p>
<p begin="00:54:24.727" end="00:54:29.927" style="s2">Amy and Kingsley proved that a lasting</p>
<p begin="00:54:27.127" end="00:54:31.627" style="s2">marriage isn&#39;t measured by age or by</p>
<p begin="00:54:29.927" end="00:54:34.627" style="s2">what people say, [music] but by</p>
<p begin="00:54:31.627" end="00:54:35.927" style="s2">character, mutual respect, and genuine</p>
<p begin="00:54:34.627" end="00:54:38.627" style="s2">loyalty.</p>
<p begin="00:54:35.927" end="00:54:41.927" style="s2">Today, their family is thriving, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:54:38.627" end="00:54:44.727" style="s2">and their story reminds us that love,</p>
<p begin="00:54:41.927" end="00:54:48.227" style="s2">when built on trust and understanding,</p>
<p begin="00:54:44.727" end="00:54:50.927" style="s2">can overcome many challenges.</p>
<p begin="00:54:48.227" end="00:54:50.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama.</p>
<p begin="00:54:52.067" end="00:54:54.088" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:54:56.652" end="00:54:58.672" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:55:03.858" end="00:55:05.878" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:55:06.327" end="00:55:10.463" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There is my girl. Did you miss me?</p>
<p begin="00:55:08.442" end="00:55:10.463" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:55:14.628" end="00:55:17.128" style="s2">She has been asking [music] for you</p>
<p begin="00:55:15.628" end="00:55:18.728" style="s2">since lunch.</p>
<p begin="00:55:17.128" end="00:55:21.628" style="s2">She refused her nap</p>
<p begin="00:55:18.728" end="00:55:21.628" style="s2">until she heard your car.</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.228" end="00:55:30.028" style="s2">Welcome home, my queen.</p>
<p begin="00:55:28.328" end="00:55:32.828" style="s2">Thank you, my love.</p>
<p begin="00:55:30.028" end="00:55:33.828" style="s2">The Kano deal is done.</p>
<p begin="00:55:32.828" end="00:55:36.328" style="s2">I never doubted [music] you for a</p>
<p begin="00:55:33.828" end="00:55:36.328" style="s2">second.</p>
<p begin="00:55:37.263" end="00:55:39.283" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:55:47.728" end="00:55:51.628" style="s2">She has your smile, Amy.</p>
<p begin="00:55:50.028" end="00:55:53.628" style="s2">And your stubbornness.</p>
<p begin="00:55:51.628" end="00:55:56.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you for watching Age Is Just a</p>
<p begin="00:55:53.628" end="00:56:00.028" style="s2">Number on Tales [music] by Amy.</p>
<p begin="00:55:56.228" end="00:56:01.828" style="s2">What would you have done in Amy&#39;s shoes?</p>
<p begin="00:56:00.028" end="00:56:04.028" style="s2">Share your thoughts in the comments.</p>
<p begin="00:56:01.828" end="00:56:07.828" style="s2">Don&#39;t forget to like and subscribe and</p>
<p begin="00:56:04.028" end="00:56:07.828" style="s2">I&#39;ll see you in the next story.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
